msgid "Drupal user account registration option?"
msgstr "Možnost registracije uporabniškega računa Drupal?"

#: js/model/crm.uf.js
msgid "Include profile edit links in search results?"
msgstr "V rezultate iskanja vključiti povezave za urejanje profila?"

#: js/model/crm.uf.js templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to include a link in the listings to Edit profile"
" fields. Only users with permission to edit the contact will see this link."
msgstr "Označite to polje, če želite v sezname vključiti povezavo za urejanje polj profila. To povezavo bodo videli samo uporabniki z dovoljenjem za urejanje stika."

#: js/model/crm.uf.js
msgid "Enable mapping for this profile?"
msgstr "Omogočiti preslikavo za ta profil?"

#: js/model/crm.uf.js templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If enabled, a Map link is included on the profile listings rows and detail "
"screens for any contacts whose records include sufficient location data for "
"your mapping provider."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, je povezava do zemljevida vključena v vrstice s seznami profilov in zaslone s podrobnostmi za vse stike, katerih zapisi vključujejo dovolj podatkov o lokaciji za vašega ponudnika kartiranja."

#: js/model/crm.uf.js
msgid "Include Drupal user account information links in search results?"
msgstr "V rezultate iskanja vključiti povezave do informacij o uporabniškem računu Drupal?"

#: js/model/crm.uf.js
msgid "Limit listings to a specific Group?"
msgstr "Omejiti sezname na določeno skupino?"

#: js/model/crm.uf.js templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Select a group if you are using this profile for search and listings, AND "
"you want to limit the listings to members of a specific group."
msgstr "Izberite skupino, če uporabljate ta profil za iskanje in sezname IN želite sezname omejiti na člane določene skupine."

#: js/model/crm.uf.js
msgid "Notify when profile form is submitted?"
msgstr "Obvestiti, ko je obrazec za profil poslan?"

#: js/model/crm.uf.js templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want member(s) of your organization to receive a notification email "
"whenever this Profile form is used to enter or update contact information, "
"enter one or more email addresses here. Multiple email addresses should be "
"separated by a comma (e.g. jane@example.org, paula@example.org). The first "
"email address listed will be used as the FROM address in the notifications."
msgstr "Če želite, da član(-i) vaše organizacije prejme e-poštno obvestilo vsakič, ko se ta obrazec profila uporabi za vnos ali posodobitev kontaktnih podatkov, tukaj vnesite enega ali več e-poštnih naslovov. Več e-poštnih naslovov je treba ločiti z vejico (npr. jane@example.org, paula@example.org). Prvi navedeni e-poštni naslov bo v obvestilih uporabljen kot naslov FROM."

#: js/model/crm.uf.js templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If you are using this profile as a contact signup or edit form, and want to "
"redirect the user to a static URL after they've submitted the form, you can "
"also use contact tokens in URL - enter the complete URL here. If this field "
"is left blank, the built-in Profile form will be redisplayed with a generic "
"status message - 'Your contact information has been saved.'"
msgstr "Če ta profil uporabljate kot obrazec za prijavo ali urejanje stikov in želite preusmeriti uporabnika na statični URL, potem ko je poslal obrazec, lahko v URL-ju uporabite tudi kontaktne žetone – tukaj vnesite celoten URL. Če to polje pustite prazno, bo vgrajen obrazec profila ponovno prikazan z splošnim statusnim sporočilom - 'Vaši kontaktni podatki so bili shranjeni.'"

#: js/model/crm.uf.js templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Weight controls the order in which profiles are presented when more than one"
" profile is included in User Registration or My Account screens. Enter a "
"positive or negative integer - lower numbers are displayed ahead of higher "
"numbers."
msgstr "Teža nadzira vrstni red, v katerem so profili predstavljeni, ko je na zaslonih Registracija uporabnika ali Moj račun vključenih več kot en profil. Vnesite pozitivno ali negativno celo število – nižje številke so prikazane pred višjimi."

