msgid "Do you want to continue?"
msgstr "Ali želite nadaljevati?"

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter a descriptive name for this permission (e.g. 'Edit Advisory Board "
"Contacts')."
msgstr "Vnesite opisno ime za to dovoljenje (npr. 'Urejanje stikov svetovalnega odbora')."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid ""
"Select a Role to assign (grant) this permission to. Select the special role "
"'Everyone' if you want to grant this permission to ALL users. 'Everyone' "
"includes anonymous (i.e. not logged in) users. Select the special role "
"'Authenticated' if you want to grant it to any logged in user."
msgstr "Izberite vlogo, ki ji želite dodeliti (dodeliti) to dovoljenje. Izberite posebno vlogo 'Vsi', če želite to dovoljenje podeliti VSEM uporabnikom. 'Vsi' vključujejo anonimne (tj. neprijavljene) uporabnike. Izberite posebno vlogo 'Authenticated', če jo želite dodeliti kateremu koli prijavljenemu uporabniku."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid "What type of operation (action) is being referenced?"
msgstr "Na katero vrsto operacije (dejanja) se sklicujete?"

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid "Select the type of data this ACL operates on."
msgstr "Izberite vrsto podatkov, s katerimi deluje ta ACL."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: The Drupal permissions for 'access all custom data' and 'profile "
"listings and forms' override and disable specific ACL settings for custom "
"field groups and profiles respectively. Do not enable those Drupal "
"permissions for a Drupal role if you want to use CiviCRM ACL's to control "
"access."
msgstr "POMEMBNO: Dovoljenja Drupal za 'dostop do vseh podatkov po meri' in 'seznami profilov in obrazci' preglasijo in onemogočijo določene nastavitve ACL za skupine polj po meri oziroma profile. Ne omogočite teh dovoljenj Drupal za vlogo Drupal, če želite za nadzor dostopa uporabljati ACL-je CiviCRM."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid "Higher priority ACL rules will override lower priority rules"
msgstr "Pravila ACL višje prioritete bodo preglasila pravila nižje prioritete"

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid ""
"Select a specific group of contacts, OR apply this permission to ALL groups."
msgstr "Izberite določeno skupino stikov ALI uporabite to dovoljenje za VSE skupine."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid "Select a specific profile, OR apply this permission to ALL profiles."
msgstr "Izberite določen profil ALI uporabite to dovoljenje za VSE profile."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid ""
"NOTE: Profile ACL operations affect which modes a profile can be used in "
"(i.e. Create a new contact, Edit your own contact record, View a contact "
"record, etc.). The Create operation is required for profiles embedded in "
"online contribution or event registration forms. None of the operations for "
"Profile ACLs grant access to administration of profiles."
msgstr "OPOMBA: Operacije ACL profila vplivajo na to, v katerih načinih je mogoče uporabiti profil (tj. ustvarite nov stik, uredite svoj zapis stika, oglejte si zapis stika itd.). Operacija Ustvari je potrebna za profile, vdelane v spletne obrazce za prispevke ali registracijo dogodka. Nobena od operacij za ACL profila ne dovoli dostopa do upravljanja profilov."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid ""
"Select a specific group of custom fields, OR apply this permission to ALL "
"custom fields."
msgstr "Izberite določeno skupino polj po meri ALI uporabite to dovoljenje za VSA polja po meri."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid "Select an event, OR apply this permission to ALL events."
msgstr "Izberite dogodek ALI uporabite to dovoljenje za VSE dogodke."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid ""
"NOTE: For Event ACLs, the 'View' operation allows access to the event "
"information screen. \"Edit\" allows users to register for the event if "
"online registration is enabled."
msgstr "OPOMBA: Za ACL dogodka operacija 'Pogled' omogoča dostop do zaslona z informacijami o dogodku. »Uredi« omogoča uporabnikom, da se prijavijo na dogodek, če je omogočena spletna registracija."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/ACL.tpl
msgid ""
"Please remember that Drupal's \"register for events\" permission overrides "
"CiviCRM's control over event information access."
msgstr "Ne pozabite, da Drupalovo dovoljenje \"registracija za dogodke\" preglasi nadzor CiviCRM nad dostopom do informacij o dogodkih."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/EntityRole.tpl
msgid "Assign ACL Role"
msgstr "Dodeli vlogo ACL"

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/EntityRole.tpl
msgid "Delete ACL Role Assignment"
msgstr "Izbriši nalogo ACL vlogi"

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/EntityRole.tpl
msgid "WARNING: Deleting this option will remove this ACL Role Assignment."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Če izbrišete to možnost, boste odstranili to dodelitev vloge ACL."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/EntityRole.tpl
msgid "Select an ACL Role to assign."
msgstr "Izberite vlogo ACL, ki jo želite dodeliti."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/EntityRole.tpl
msgid ""
"Select a group of contacts who should have this role when logged in to your "
"site. Groups must be assigned the 'Access Control' type (Contacts &raquo; "
"Manage Groups &raquo; Settings) to be included in this list."
msgstr "Izberite skupino stikov, ki naj bi imeli to vlogo, ko se prijavite na vašo spletno stran. Skupinam je treba dodeliti vrsto 'Access Control' (Kontakti &raquo; Manage Groups &raquo; Settings), ki bo vključena na ta seznam."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/WordPress/Permissions.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to Grant access to CiviCRM components and other CiviCRM "
"permissions to WordPress roles."
msgstr "Uporabite ta obrazec za Grant dostop do komponent CiviCRM in drugih dovoljenj CiviCRM WordPress vloge."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Form/WordPress/Permissions.tpl
msgid ""
"<strong>NOTE: Super Admin</strong> and <strong>Administrator</strong> roles "
"will have all permissions in CiviCRM."
msgstr "<strong>NOTE: Super Admin</strong> in <strong>administrator</strong> vloge bodo imeli vsa dovoljenja v CiviCRM."

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Header.tpl
msgid "Access Control Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentacija za nadzor dostopa"

#: templates/CRM/ACL/Header.tpl
msgid ""
"ACLs allow you to control access to CiviCRM data. An ACL consists of an "
"<strong>Operation</strong> (e.g. 'View' or 'Edit'), a <strong>set of "
"data</strong> that the operation can be performed on (e.g. a group of "
"contacts), and a <strong>Role</strong> that has permission to do this "
"operation. Refer to the %1 for more info."
msgstr "ACL vam omogočajo nadzor dostopa do podatkov CiviCRM.<strong>Delovanje</strong>(npr. 'View' ali 'Edit'), a<strong>niz podatkov</strong>da se operacija lahko izvaja (npr. skupina stikov) in<strong>Vloga</strong>ki ima dovoljenje za to operacijo.%1Za več informacij."

