#: templates/CRM/Activity/Form/Activity.hlp
msgid ""
"With separate activities, you can enter different activity information for "
"different contacts after creating the activities."
msgstr "Z ločenimi dejavnostmi lahko po ustvarjanju aktivnosti vnesete različne informacije o aktivnostih za različne stike."

#: templates/CRM/Activity/Form/Activity.hlp
msgid ""
"With a single activity, the activity information cannot be customized for "
"each contact."
msgstr "Z eno samo dejavnostjo informacij o dejavnosti ni mogoče prilagoditi za vsak stik."

#: templates/CRM/Activity/Form/Activity.hlp
msgid ""
"You can optionally assign this activity to someone. Assigned activities will"
" appear in their Activities listing at CiviCRM Home."
msgstr "To dejavnost lahko po želji dodelite nekomu. Dodeljene aktivnosti se bodo pojavile na seznamu dejavnosti na domu CiviCRM."

#: templates/CRM/Activity/Form/Activity.hlp
msgid ""
"When CiviCRM emails a copy of this activity to each assignees, that email "
"will come from the contact listed under \"Added By\"."
msgstr "Ko CiviCRM pošlje kopijo te dejavnosti vsakemu dodeljenemu, bo ta e-pošta prišla iz stika, ki je naveden pod \"Added by\"."

#: templates/CRM/Activity/Form/Activity.hlp
msgid ""
"If (in rare cases) that contact has no email address, then CiviCRM will send"
" the email from the default \"from\" email address configured for this "
"domain. And finally, if that email address has not been configured, then "
"CiviCRM will send the email from the email address associated with the "
"currently logged in user who creates this activity."
msgstr "Če (v redkih primerih) ta stik nima e- poštnega naslova, potem bo CiviCRM poslal e-pošto iz privzetega e- poštnega naslova, nastavljenega za to domeno. In končno, če ta e-poštni naslov ni konfiguriran, bo CiviCRM poslal e-pošto iz e- poštnega naslova, povezanega s trenutno prijavljenim uporabnikom, ki ustvarja to dejavnost."

