#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"If you are using the CiviMail component to send mailings to contacts, this "
"field provides additional control over which email address is used. By "
"default, CiviMail sends mail to each contact's preferred email address. If "
"the contact has multiple locations, then the preferred email of the primary "
"location is used. However, if the contact prefers to have CiviMail ('bulk') "
"mailings set to an alternate email address - check the 'Use for Bulk "
"Mailings' box next to that email address."
msgstr "Če uporabljate komponento CiviMail za pošiljanje sporočil stikom, to polje zagotavlja dodaten nadzor nad tem, kateri e-poštni naslov se uporablja. Privzeto CiviMail pošilja pošto vsakemu kontaktnemu elektronskemu naslovu. Če ima kontakt več lokacij, potem se uporabi najprimernejša e-pošta primarne lokacije. Vendar pa, če ima stik raje CiviMail ('bulk') pošto nastavljeno na drug e-poštni naslov - preverite polje 'Uporabi za masovno pošto' poleg tega e- poštnega naslova."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"This option is designed to be set by the contact themselves when they don't "
"want to receive bulk email from your organization (they set it using the "
"opt-out action from a CiviMail mailing).   Please think before changing it, "
"as it will override the preference they have set."
msgstr "Ta možnost je zasnovana tako, da jo nastavite sami stiki, ko ne želijo prejemati velike količine e-pošte od vaše organizacije (nastavijo jo z uporabo izjem od pošte CiviMail). Razmislite, preden jo spremenite, saj bo zaobšla želje, ki so jih določili."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"This flag is most commonly used to mark an email address that is bouncing. "
"If you are using the CiviMail component, emails that bounce excessively are "
"automatically placed on hold and mailings are not sent to this address as "
"long as it is marked hold. You can also set (or unset) this option manually "
"- but remember that emails will not be sent to this address as long as it is"
" marked 'On Hold'."
msgstr "Ta zastavica se najpogosteje uporablja za označevanje e- poštnega naslova, ki se odskakuje. Če uporabljate komponento CiviMail, se e-pošte, ki se pretirano odbijajo, samodejno namestijo na ta naslov in pošta ni poslana na ta naslov, dokler je označena. To možnost lahko tudi ročno nastavite (ali izklopite) - vendar ne pozabite, da e-pošte ne bodo poslane na ta naslov, dokler je označena z » On Hold «."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid "Select the preferred method(s) of communicating with this contact."
msgstr "Izberite najprimernejšo(-e) metodo(-e) komuniciranja s tem stikom."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid "Select the appropriate Privacy Options."
msgstr "Izberite ustrezne možnosti zasebnosti."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Contacts with 'Do not email' will be excluded from receiving CiviMail "
"mailings, and the Send Email activity will be disabled for them. However "
"they will still receive email for contribution receipts and event "
"registration confirmations."
msgstr "Kontakti z 'Ne e-pošto' bodo izključeni iz prejemanja pošte CiviMail, dejavnost Pošlji e-pošto pa bo onemogočena zanje. Vseeno pa bodo še vedno prejemali e-pošto za prejem prispevkov in potrditev prijave dogodkov."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Contacts with 'Do not SMS' will be excluded from receiving Bulk SMS "
"messages, and the Send SMS activity will be disabled."
msgstr "Kontakti z 'Ne SMS' bodo izključeni iz prejemanja sporočil Bulk SMS, dejavnost Send SMS pa bo onemogočena."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Contacts with 'Do not mail' will be excluded when mailing labels are "
"created."
msgstr "Kontakti z 'Ne mail' bodo izključeni, ko bodo ustvarjene poštne oznake."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to link this address to another contact's "
"address. For example, you might want to link a person's \"Work\" address to "
"their employer's address. Or, you might want to link their \"Home\" address "
"to a Household record. Changes made to the linked address will automatically"
" be applied to this address. For example, if you use an employer "
"(organization) address for an individual's work address - any updates to the"
" employer address will also be applied to the individual's work address."
msgstr "Izberite to možnost, če želite ta naslov povezati z drugim kontaktnim naslovom. Na primer, morda boste želeli povezati naslov osebe \"Delo\" na naslov delodajalca. Ali pa boste morda želeli svoj naslov \"Doma\" povezati z zapisom gospodinjstva. Spremembe na povezani naslov bodo samodejno uporabljene na ta naslov. Na primer, če uporabite naslov delodajalca (organizacija) za delovni naslov posameznika - vse posodobitve naslova delodajalca se bodo uporabljale tudi na naslov posameznika."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"You can use an address belonging to an existing contact or create a new "
"contact by selecting the desired contact type from the select field. If you "
"link an individual's address to an organization, an employee-employer "
"relationship will be automatically created. If you link an individual's "
"address to a household, a household member relationship is created."
msgstr "Lahko uporabite naslov, ki pripada obstoječemu stiku ali ustvarite nov stik z izbiro želenega tipa stika iz izbranega polja. Če povežete naslov posameznika z organizacijo, se samodejno ustvari odnos med zaposlenim in zaposlenim. Če povežete naslov posameznika z gospodinjstvom, se ustvari odnos med članom gospodinjstva."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Set this organization as the current employer for this individual. Note: "
"will disable any existing employer relationship for this individual."
msgstr "Nastavite to organizacijo kot trenutnega delodajalca za tega posameznika. Opomba: onemogoči vse obstoječe razmerje delodajalca za tega posameznika."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Choose how you communicate with this contact, e.g. on formal or familiar "
"terms."
msgstr "Izberite, kako komunicirate s tem stikom, npr. pod formalnimi ali znanimi pogoji."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Depending on the CiviCRM setup, email and postal greetings (see below) may "
"be automatically adapted accordingly; or the information can be used in "
"other ways."
msgstr "Glede na nastavitev CiviCRM se lahko e-poštni in poštni pozdravi (glej spodaj) samodejno ustrezno prilagodijo; ali pa se lahko informacije uporabijo na druge načine."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Use the greeting/address options to determine how you would like the "
"contact's salutation and name displayed for different communication methods."
" When you send an email or export a list of records to a .csv file for mail "
"merging, the greeting and addressee fields will reflect your preferences."
msgstr "Uporabite možnosti pozdrava/naslova, da ugotovite, kako bi želeli pozdrav in ime za različne načine komuniciranja. Ko pošljete e-pošto ali izvozite seznam zapisov v datoteko . csv za združevanje pošte, bodo polja pozdrava in naslovnika odražala vaše želje."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"You may also create a customized greeting and use field tokens to insert "
"fields of your choice. For more information on available tokens, see the "
"online documentation %1."
msgstr "Lahko ustvarite tudi prilagojen pozdrav in uporabite žetone polja za vstavljanje polj po vaši izbiri. Za več informacij o žetonih si oglejte spletno dokumentacijo %1."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"CiviCRM will attempt to split street addresses into separate elements "
"(street number, street name and unit/apt) to help you make lists and reports"
" where you need to sort by street number (and/or separate addresses with odd"
" and even numbers). For most addresses, this is done for you automatically. "
"However, you can manually edit these elements, and potentially handle "
"addresses that are in unusual formats, by clicking 'Edit Address Elements'."
msgstr "CiviCRM bo poskušal razdeliti naslove ulic na ločene elemente (ulična številka, ime ulice in enota/apt), da vam bo pomagal narediti sezname in poročila, kjer morate razvrstiti po številkah ulic (in/ali ločenih naslovov z nenavadnimi in enakomernimi številkami). Za večino naslovov je to narejeno za vas samodejno. Vendar lahko te elemente ročno urejate in morda obravnavate naslove, ki so v nenavadnih formatih, s klikom na »Edit Address Elements«."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Click here to return to editing the street address as a single field. "
"Addresses which don't fit the expected format for address elements can still"
" be saved by entering them in the single 'Street Address' field."
msgstr "Kliknite tukaj, da se vrnete na urejanje naslova ulice kot eno samo polje. Naslovi, ki ne ustrezajo pričakovani obliki za naslovne elemente, se lahko še vedno shranijo, če jih vnesete v polje » Ulica «."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"You can select an existing organization record here, OR type in the name of "
"a new organization if this person's employer is not already in your "
"database. However, if you want this person to share their work address with "
"their employer AND that organization doesn't exist yet - leave this field "
"blank and use the Shared Address feature in the Address pane below to create"
" the employer record AND enter the employer address. The 'current employer' "
"relationship will be automatically created for you."
msgstr "Izberete lahko obstoječi organizacijski zapis tukaj, ALI vtipkajte v ime nove organizacije, če delodajalec te osebe še ni v vaši bazi podatkov. Če pa želite, da ta oseba deli svoj delovni naslov s svojim delodajalcem IN ta organizacija še ne obstaja - pustite to polje prazno in uporabite funkcijo Deljeni naslov v spodnjem delu naslova za ustvarjanje zapisa delodajalca IN vnesite naslov delodajalca. Razmerje 'trenutnega delodajalca' bo samodejno ustvarjeno za vas."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Record one or more web addresses (URLs) associated with this contact. "
"Examples include personal web addresses like a Facebook or Twitter page, as "
"well as links to a company or organization web site or page."
msgstr "Zabeležite enega ali več spletnih naslovov (URL), povezanih s tem stikom. Primeri vključujejo osebne spletne naslove, kot so Facebook ali Twitter stran, kot tudi povezave do podjetja ali organizacije spletne strani ali strani."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Upload a photo or icon that you want to be displayed when viewing this "
"contact."
msgstr "Naložite fotografijo ali ikono, ki jo želite prikazati ob ogledu tega stika."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Every contact in CiviCRM has a unique ID number. This number will never "
"change and is the most accurate way of identifying a contact."
msgstr "Vsak stik v CiviCRM ima edinstveno identifikacijsko številko. Ta številka se ne bo nikoli spremenila in je najbolj natančen način identifikacije stika."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this field to store a unique identifier. This is generally used to link "
"contacts with records in a related or legacy application. When migrating "
"data from another system, import the unique contact identifier from the old "
"system to this field. You can then use it to match imported contributions "
"and other transactional data to the corresponding contact record."
msgstr "Uporabite to polje za shranjevanje edinstvene oznake. To se običajno uporablja za povezavo stikov z zapisi v povezanem ali obstoječem programu. Pri selitvi podatkov iz drugega sistema uvozite edinstven identifikator stika iz starega sistema v to polje. Nato ga lahko uporabite za ujemanje uvoženih prispevkov in drugih podatkov o transakcijah z ustreznim kontaktnim zapisom."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Enter a descriptive name for this address block such as \"Summer Home\", "
"\"School Address\", etc."
msgstr "Vnesite opisno ime za ta naslovni blok, kot so » Poletni dom«, »Šolski naslov« itd."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/OnBehalfOf.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter optional 'add-on' code after the dash ('plus 4' code for U.S. "
"addresses)."
msgstr "Vpiše se neobvezna koda „dodatek“ po pomišljaju („plus 4“ koda za naslove ZDA)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/OnBehalfOf.tpl
msgid ""
"(Refer to the Mapping and Geocoding section in the Installation and Basic "
"Setup Chapter)"
msgstr "(glej oddelek za kartiranje in geokodiranje v poglavju o namestitvi in osnovni pripravi)"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/OnBehalfOf.tpl
msgid ""
"Latitude and longitude may be automatically populated by enabling a Mapping "
"Provider."
msgstr "Zemljepisna širina in dolžina sta lahko samodejno poseljeni z omogočanjem ponudnika kart."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to assign latitude and longitude manually rather "
"than letting your mapping provider assign it. This is useful for addresses "
"in locations where your mapping provider is not able to provide accurate "
"geocoding."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, če želite ročno dodeliti zemljepisno širino in dolžino, namesto da bi vaš ponudnik kartiranja to določil. To je uporabno za naslove na lokacijah, kjer vaš ponudnik kartiranja ne more zagotoviti točnega geokodiranja."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid "Street number, street name, apartment/unit/suite - OR P.O. box."
msgstr "Ulična številka, ime ulice, stanovanje/enota/suite - ali poštni predal."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/OnBehalfOf.tpl
msgid ""
"Supplemental address info, e.g. c/o, department name, building name, etc."
msgstr "Dodatne informacije o naslovu, npr. c/o, ime oddelka, ime stavbe itd."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this field to store a description of how/why this contact was added to "
"the database. This field is usually auto-filled when a contact is created "
"from a public form i.e. Event Registration."
msgstr "Uporabite to polje za shranjevanje opisa, kako / zakaj je bil ta stik dodan v bazo podatkov. To polje se običajno samodejno napolni, ko je stik ustvarjen iz javnega obrazca, tj. registracije dogodka."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid "Click here to configure the panes."
msgstr "Kliknite tukaj, da nastavite plošče."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid "Expand all tabs"
msgstr "Razširi vse zavihke"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid "Contact Details"
msgstr "Podrobnosti stika"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid "Collapse all tabs"
msgstr "Zloži vse zavihke"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid ""
"One or more contact subtypes have been de-selected from the list for this "
"contact. Any custom data associated with de-selected subtype will be removed"
" as long as the contact does not have a contact subtype still selected. "
"Click OK to proceed, or Cancel to review your changes before saving."
msgstr "Eden ali več kontaktnih podtipov je bilo izbranih iz seznama za ta stik. Vsi podatki po meri, povezani z deizbranim podtipom, bodo odstranjeni, dokler stik nima še izbranega kontaktnega podtipa. Kliknite V redu za nadaljevanje ali Prekliči, da pregledate svoje spremembe pred shranjevanjem."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/CustomDataView.tpl
msgid "The record will be deleted immediately. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Zapis bo takoj izbrisan. Tega dejanja ni mogoče razveljaviti."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid "Similar Contact Found"
msgstr "Podobno najdeno v stiku"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid "Similar Contacts Found"
msgstr "Najdeni podobni stiki"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid ""
"If the contact you were trying to add is listed below, click their name to "
"view or edit their record"
msgstr "Če je stik, ki ste ga poskušali dodati, naveden spodaj, kliknite na njihovo ime za ogled ali urejanje zapisa"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid "Fetching Matches"
msgstr "Pridobivanje ujemanj"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid "Checking for similar contacts..."
msgstr "Preverjanje podobnih stikov..."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Contact.tpl
msgid "No matches found using the default Supervised deduping rule."
msgstr "Ni zadetkov z uporabo privzetega pravila za deduping."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeFind.tpl
msgid ""
"You can search all contacts for duplicates or limit the results for better performance.\n"
"      If you limit by group then it will look for matches with that group both inside and outside of the group.\n"
"      You can also limit the contacts in the group to be matched by specifying the number of contacts to match. This can be done in conjunction with a group or separately and is recommended for performance reasons.\n"
"    "
msgstr "Vse stike lahko poiščete za podvojene ali omejite rezultate za boljšo učinkovitost.\n      Če omejite po skupini, potem bo iskal tekme s to skupino tako znotraj kot zunaj skupine.\n      Prav tako lahko omejite stike v skupini, ki se ujemajo z določitvijo števila stikov, ki se ujemajo. To lahko storite v povezavi s skupino ali ločeno in se priporoča zaradi uspešnosti.\n    "

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Matching Rule for %1 Contacts"
msgstr "Uskladitveno pravilo za stike z %1"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid ""
"Configure up to five fields to evaluate when searching for 'suspected' "
"duplicate contact records."
msgstr "Nastavite do pet polj, da ocenite med iskanjem 'sumljivih' podvojenih kontaktnih zapisov."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Enter descriptive name for this matching rule."
msgstr "Vnesite opisno ime za to pravilo ujemanja."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Uporaba"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Currently set to: "
msgstr "Trenutno nastavljeno na: "

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "To change the usage for this rule, please configure another rule as %1"
msgstr "Če želite spremeniti uporabo tega pravila, nastavite drugo pravilo kot %1"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Change usage"
msgstr "Spremeni uporabo"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid ""
"WARNING: Once a rule is marked as reserved it can not be deleted and the "
"fields and weights can not be modified."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Ko je pravilo označeno kot rezervirano, ga ni mogoče izbrisati in polj in uteži ni mogoče spremeniti."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid ""
"This reserved rule is pre-configured with matching fields to optimize dedupe"
" scanning performance. It matches on:"
msgstr "To rezervirano pravilo je prednastavljeno z ujemajočimi se polji za optimizacijo učinkovitosti skeniranja. Ujema se na:"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Email only"
msgstr "Samo e- pošta"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Middle Name (if present)"
msgstr "Srednje ime (če je prisotno)"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Suffix (if present)"
msgstr "Pripona (če je prisotna)"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Street Address (if present)"
msgstr "Ulični naslov (če obstaja)"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Birth Date (if present)"
msgstr "Datum rojstva (če je prisoten)"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Note: You cannot edit fields for a reserved rule."
msgstr "Opomba: Polja za rezervirano pravilo ne morete urejati."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "Teža"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid ""
"CiviCRM includes three types of dedupe rule. <strong>You can only configure "
"one 'Unsupervised' and one 'Supervised' rule for each contact type, but you "
"can configure any number of additional 'General' rules to provide other "
"criteria to scan for possible duplicates.</strong>"
msgstr "CiviCRM vključuje tri vrste pravil dedupe. <strong>Za vsako vrsto stikov lahko nastavite samo eno pravilo 'Nenadzorovano' in eno pravilo 'nadzorovano', lahko pa nastavite poljubno število dodatnih 'splošnih' pravil, da bi zagotovili druga merila za skeniranje morebitnih dvojnikov.</strong>"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid ""
"Selecting 'Unsupervised' or 'Supervised' will convert the previously "
"configured rule of that type to 'General'."
msgstr "Če izberete 'Nenadzorovano' ali 'nadzorovano', bo predhodno nastavljeno pravilo tega tipa spremenjeno v 'Splošno'."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.hlp
msgid ""
"The 'Unsupervised' rule for each contact type is automatically used when new"
" contacts are created through online registrations including Events, "
"Membership, Contributions and Profile pages. They are also selected by "
"default when you Import contacts. They are generally configured with a "
"narrow definition of what constitutes a duplicate."
msgstr "Pravilo 'Nenadzorovano' za vsako vrsto stikov se samodejno uporabi, kadar se prek spletnih registracij ustvarijo novi stiki, vključno z dogodki, članstvom, prispevki in profilnimi stranmi. Ti so tudi privzeto izbrani, ko uvažate stike. Na splošno so nastavljeni z ozko definicijo tega, kar predstavlja dvojnik."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.hlp
msgid ""
"The 'Supervised' rule for each contact type is automatically used to check "
"for possible duplicates when contacts are added or edited via the user "
"interface. Supervised Rules should be configured with a broader definition "
"of what constitutes a duplicate."
msgstr "Pravilo » Nadzorovano« za vsako vrsto stikov se samodejno uporablja za preverjanje morebitnih dvojnikov, ko so stiki dodani ali urejeni prek uporabniškega vmesnika. Nadzorovana pravila je treba konfigurirati s širšo opredelitvijo tega, kar je dvojnik."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid ""
"You can configure any number of 'General' rules, to provide other criteria "
"to scan for possible duplicates."
msgstr "Nastavite lahko katero koli število splošnih pravil, da zagotovite druga merila za iskanje morebitnih dvojnikov."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Domain.hlp
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the organization or entity which owns this CiviCRM domain."
" Use the %1 token to include this value in mailing content. It is used in "
"the default Opt-out Message."
msgstr "Vnesite ime organizacije ali subjekta, ki je lastnik te domene CiviCRM. Uporabite žeton %1 za vključitev te vrednosti v vsebino pošiljanja. Uporablja se v privzetem sporočilu Opt-out."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Domain.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also include general email and/or phone contact information in "
"mailings by filling in the fields below, and then using the %2 and %3 tokens"
" in your mailings. These are particularly useful for inclusion in pre-"
"configured mailing <a href='%1'>Headers or Footers</a>."
msgstr "V pošiljanje lahko vključite tudi splošno e-pošto in/ali telefonske kontaktne podatke, tako da izpolnite spodnja polja, nato pa uporabite žetona %2 in %3. Ti sta še posebej uporabni za vključitev v vnaprej nastavljeno pošto <a href='%1'>G ali Footers</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Domain.tpl
msgid ""
"The name of the organization or entity which owns this CiviCRM site or "
"domain. This is the default organization contact record."
msgstr "Ime organizacije ali subjekta, ki ima v lasti to mesto ali domeno CiviCRM. To je privzeti zapis stikov organizacije."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Domain.tpl
msgid ""
"Optional description of this domain (useful for sites with multiple "
"domains)."
msgstr "Neobvezen opis te domene (koristen za mesta z več domenami)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Domain.tpl
msgid "Default Organization Address"
msgstr "Privzeti naslov organizacije"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Domain.tpl
msgid ""
"CiviMail mailings must include the sending organization's address. This is "
"done by putting the %1 token in either the body or footer of the mailing. "
"This token may also be used in regular 'Email - send now' messages and in "
"other Message Templates. The token is replaced by the address entered below "
"when the message is sent."
msgstr "Pošta CiviMail mora vsebovati naslov organizacije pošiljateljice. To se naredi tako, da se simbol %1 vnese bodisi v telo bodisi v podnožje pošiljanja. Ta žeton se lahko uporabi tudi v rednih sporočilih » Email - pošlji zdaj « in v drugih predlogah sporočila. Žeton se nadomesti z naslovom, vnešenim spodaj, ko je sporočilo poslano."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Domain.tpl
msgid "Organization Contact Information"
msgstr "Kontaktni podatki organizacije"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Domain.tpl
msgid ""
"You can also include general email and/or phone contact information in "
"mailings."
msgstr "Pri pošiljanju pošte lahko vključite tudi splošne e-poštne in/ali telefonske podatke stika."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Domain.tpl
msgid "Edit Domain Information"
msgstr "Uredi podatke o domeni"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Address/street_address.tpl
msgid "Edit Address Elements"
msgstr "Uredi naslovne elemente"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Address/street_address.tpl
msgid "Edit Street Address"
msgstr "Uredi naslov ulice"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Address/street_address.tpl
msgid "Edit Complete Street Address"
msgstr "Uredi celoten naslov ulice"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Address.tpl
msgid "Supplemental Address"
msgstr "Dodatni naslov"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Address.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Inline/Address.tpl
msgid ""
"This address is shared with %1 contact record(s). Modifying this address "
"will automatically update the shared address for these contacts."
msgstr "Ta naslov se deli z %1 kontaktnimi zapisi. Sprememba tega naslova bo samodejno posodobila skupni naslov za te stike."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Address.tpl
msgid "Delete Address Block"
msgstr "Zbriši blok naslova"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Address.tpl
msgid "Delete this address"
msgstr "Zbriši ta naslov"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Address.tpl
msgid "Another Address"
msgstr "Drug naslov"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Address.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Inline/Address.tpl
msgid ""
"has already been assigned to another address. Please select another location"
" for this address."
msgstr "je že bil dodeljen drugemu naslovu. Izberite drugo lokacijo za ta naslov."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/CommunicationPreferences.tpl
msgid "Greeting"
msgstr "Pozdrav"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Email.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Inline/Email.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Inline/IM.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Inline/OpenID.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Inline/Phone.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Inline/Website.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid "add"
msgstr "dodaj"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Email.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Inline/Email.tpl
msgid "On Hold?"
msgstr "Na čakanju?"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Edit/Email.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Inline/Email.tpl
msgid "Bulk Mailings?"
msgstr "Pošiljke v razsutem stanju?"

