#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.hlp
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Merge</strong> to move data from the Duplicate Contact on the "
"left into the Main Contact. In addition to the contact data (address, phone,"
" email...), you may choose to move all or some of the related records "
"(groups, activities, tags, etc.)."
msgstr "Klik<strong>Združi</strong>da premaknete podatke iz Podvojenega stika na levi v Glavni stik. Poleg kontaktnih podatkov (naslov, telefon, e-pošta...) lahko izberete, da premaknete vse ali nekatere povezane zapise (skupine, dejavnosti, oznake itd.)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.hlp
msgid ""
"You will see a row and a checkbox for each type of related data currently "
"linked to the duplicate contact. For example, if the duplicate contact has "
"Activity records - you will see a row and a checkbox for you to mark IF you "
"want those contribution records moved over to the main contact record. If "
"you want to move all related records, you can check the <strong>Mark "
"All</strong> checkbox."
msgstr "Videli boste vrstico in potrditveno polje za vsako vrsto povezanih podatkov, ki so trenutno povezani z dvojnikom stika. Na primer, če ima dvojnik stika zapise o dejavnosti - videli boste vrstico in potrditveno polje za vas, da označite, če želite, da se ti zapisi o prispevku premaknejo v glavni kontaktni zapis. Če želite premakniti vse povezane zapise, lahko preverite potrditveno polje <strong>Mark All</strong>."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.hlp
msgid ""
"The Duplicate Contact record and all related information WILL BE DELETED "
"after the Merge is complete."
msgstr "Podvojeni kontaktni zapis in vse s tem povezane informacije bodo po končanem spajanju izbrisane."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Merge</strong> to move data from the Duplicate Contact on the "
"left into the Main Contact. In addition to the contact data (address, phone,"
" email...), you may choose to move all or some of the related activity "
"records (groups, contributions, memberships, etc.)."
msgstr "Klik<strong>Združi</strong>da premaknete podatke iz Podvojenega stika na levi v Glavni stik. Poleg kontaktnih podatkov (naslov, telefon, e-pošta...) se lahko odločite za premik vseh ali nekaterih povezanih zapisov dejavnosti (skupine, prispevki, članstvo itd.)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid ""
"WARNING: The duplicate contact record WILL BE DELETED after the merge is "
"complete."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Ko bo združitev končana, bo dvojni kontaktni zapis izbrisan."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid ""
"WARNING: There are %1 user accounts associated with both the original and duplicate contacts. Ensure that the %1 user you want to retain is on the right - if necessary use the 'Flip between original and duplicate contacts.' option at top to swap the positions of the two records before doing the merge.\n"
"  The user record associated with the duplicate contact will not be deleted, but will be unlinked from the associated contact record (which will be deleted).\n"
"  You will need to manually delete that user (click on the link to open the %1 user account in new screen). You may need to give thought to how you handle any content or contents associated with that user."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Obstajajo uporabniški računi %1, povezani z izvirnimi in dvojnimi stiki. Prepričajte se, da je uporabnik %1, ki ga želite obdržati, na desni - po potrebi uporabite možnost »Flip med originalnimi in dvojnimi stiki«.\nZapis uporabnika, povezan z dvojnikom stika, ne bo izbrisan, ampak bo nepovezan iz povezanega zapisa stikov (ki bo izbrisan).\nTo uporabnika boste morali ročno izbrisati (kliknite na povezavo, da odprete uporabniški račun %1 v novem zaslonu). Morda boste morali razmisliti, kako ravnati z vsebino ali vsebino, povezano s tem uporabnikom."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid "Flip between original and duplicate contacts."
msgstr "Obrnite med originalnimi in podvojenimi stiki."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid "Mark this pair as not a duplicate."
msgstr "Označi ta par kot ne dvojnik."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid "Show/hide rows with the same data on each contact record."
msgstr "Prikaži/skrij vrstice z istimi podatki v vsakem imeniku."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid "duplicate"
msgstr "dvojnik"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid "Mark All"
msgstr "Označi vse"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Merge.tpl
msgid "Add/overwrite?"
msgstr "Dodaj/prepišem?"

