#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Use <strong>&#37;</strong> wildcard(s) for partial matches. EXAMPLE: Enter "
"'Volunteer&#37;' as your Activity Type to match any activity whose type is "
"'Volunteer' + any other words (e.g. Volunteer for Open House)."
msgstr "Uporaba<strong>&#37;</strong>divje karte za delne tekme. PRIMER: Vnesite » Volunteer&#37;\"kot vaš tip dejavnosti, da se ujemajo z vsemi dejavnostmi, katerih tip je 'Prostovoljec' + vse druge besede (npr. prostovoljec za odprt dom)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"When multiple options are selected within a search field the selections are combined using <strong>OR</strong> criteria (e.g. selecting both 'Group A' and 'Group B' will find contacts who are either in 'Group A' OR 'Group B' or in both).</p>\n"
"  <p>By default the different search fields are combined using the <strong>AND</strong> Search Operator (e.g. selecting Tag is 'Age' AND Country is 'Canada' returns only those contacts who meet both criteria). You can override the Search Operator default for combining different fields in the Search Settings."
msgstr "Ko je v iskalnem polju izbranih več možnosti, se izbira združi z uporabo<strong>ALI</strong>merila (npr. izbira \"skupine A\" in \"skupine B\" bo našla stike, ki so bodisi v \"skupini A\" ALI \"skupini B\" ali v obeh).</p>\n  <p>Privzeto so različna iskalna polja združena z uporabo<strong>IN</strong>Operater iskanja (npr. izbira oznake je 'Age' IN Država je 'Kanada' vrne le tiste stike, ki izpolnjujejo oba merila). Privzeto lahko prevladate nad operaterjem iskanja za združevanje različnih polj v nastavitvah iskanja."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"If you've changed search criteria for this 'smart group' and want to save "
"your changes, select <strong>Group - update smart group</strong> from the '-"
" more actions -' drop-down menu"
msgstr "Če ste spremenili kriterije iskanja za to \"pametno skupino\" in želite shraniti svoje spremembe, izberite <strong>Group - posodobite pametno skupino</strong> iz spustnega menija '- več dejanj -'"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Contacts with any of the checked privacy options are EXCLUDED from your "
"search results by default. EXAMPLE: If you select 'Do not phone', and search"
" for contacts with an address in a specific city - then contacts in that "
"city who have 'Do not phone' selected as a privacy option will be excluded "
"from the search results."
msgstr "Kontakti s katero koli od preverjenih možnosti zasebnosti so privzeto IZKLJUČENI iz vaših rezultatov iskanja. PRIMER: Če izberete »Ne telefoniraj« in iščete stike z naslovom v določenem mestu - potem bodo stiki v tem mestu, ki imajo »Ne telefoniraj«, izbrani kot možnost zasebnosti, izključeni iz rezultatov iskanja."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want to FIND (include) contacts with a particular privacy option set,"
" then click the 'Include' radio button."
msgstr "Če želite najti (vključiti) stike z določeno izbiro zasebnosti, nato kliknite gumb 'Include' radio."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"If you select multiple privacy options, your choices are combined with OR "
"statements by default. EXAMPLE: If you select 'Do not phone' and 'Do not "
"email', results will include contacts who have either or both preferences. "
"If you want to return only contacts with both preferences, select the AND "
"operator."
msgstr "Če izberete več možnosti zasebnosti, so vaše izbire združene z izjavami OR privzeto. PRIMER: Če izberete » Ne telefoniraj« in »Ne pošiljaj e- pošte«, bodo rezultati vključevali stike, ki imajo eno ali obe možnosti. Če želite povrniti le stike z obema željama, izberite operaterja IN."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Advanced Search returns your results as Contact records by default. However,"
" you may want to get another record type instead. For example, you may want "
"to see all the Activity records which match your search criteria."
msgstr "Advanced Search vrne vaše rezultate kot Privzete evidence stikov. Vendar pa boste morda želeli dobiti drugo vrsto zapisa. Morda boste želeli videti vse zapise dejavnosti, ki ustrezajo vašim iskalnim kriterijem."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"If you are displaying the search results as contacts, you can modify the "
"columns displayed by creating a Profile containing a different set of "
"contact fields and then selecting that Profile here. For example you may "
"want to include columns for Gender and Date of Birth, while eliminating "
"Country."
msgstr "Če prikazujete rezultate iskanja kot stike, lahko spremenite prikazane stolpce tako, da ustvarite profil, ki vsebuje drugačen nabor kontaktnih polj in nato izberete profil tukaj. Na primer, če želite vključiti stolpce za spol in datum rojstva, medtem ko odpravljate državo."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Determines whether your criteria are combined with AND statements, or "
"combined with OR statements. For example, you may want to find all "
"individuals who are in the Volunteers group AND who have a Volunteer "
"Training activity recorded for them. In this case use the AND operator. If "
"you need to find everyone who is in the Volunteers group OR has a Volunteer "
"Training activity recorded, use the OR operator."
msgstr "Določa, ali so vaša merila združena z izjavami IN ali z izjavami OR. Na primer, želite najti vse posameznike, ki so v skupini prostovoljcev IN ki imajo za njih zabeleženo prostovoljsko usposabljanje. V tem primeru uporabite operaterja IN. Če morate najti vsakogar, ki je v skupini prostovoljcev ALI ima zabeleženo prostovoljsko usposabljanje, uporabite operaterja OR."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this filter to limit search results to relationships where the related "
"contacts are part of a specific group or groups. For example, you might want"
" to find all individuals who are employees ('Employee of' relationship type)"
" of organizations which are in your 'Corporate Sponsors' group."
msgstr "Uporabite ta filter, da omejite rezultate iskanja na razmerja, kjer so povezani stiki del določene skupine ali skupine. Na primer, morda želite najti vse posameznike, ki so zaposleni (»delojemalec« vrste odnosov) organizacij, ki so v vaši skupini 'Corporate Sponzorji'."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this filter to limit search results to relationships which were active "
"during the specified time period (e.g. this is useful if you need to search "
"all volunteer relationships that were active during 2014)."
msgstr "Uporabite ta filter za omejitev rezultatov iskanja na odnose, ki so bili aktivni v določenem časovnem obdobju (npr. to je koristno, če morate preiskati vse prostovoljne odnose, ki so bili aktivni v letu 2014)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"By definition a relationship is active if any of these conditions occurs: "
"(1) Start Date <= Current Date <= End Date (2) Start Date <= Current Date "
"and End Date is not defined (3) Start Date is not defined and Current Date "
"<= End Date"
msgstr "Po definiciji je razmerje aktivno, če se pojavi kateri koli od teh pogojev: (1) začetni datum, ki se ne ujema s končnim datumom, (2) začetni datum in končni datum nista določena (3) Začetni datum ni določen in tekoči datum, razen končnega datuma"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Find records with tags (regular or tagset tag) which contain a complete or "
"partial word or phrase. EXAMPLE: If you have several tags that contain the "
"word 'Donor', you can find contacts tagged with any of them by entering "
"'Donor' in this field."
msgstr "Poiščite zapise z značkami (navadna ali značka), ki vsebujejo popolno ali delno besedo ali frazo. PRIMER: Če imate več značk, ki vsebujejo besedo » Donor«, lahko najdete stike, označene s katerim koli od njih, tako da vnesete » Donor « v to polje."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to search for tagged activities or cases (in "
"addition to contact records)."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, če želite poiskati označene aktivnosti ali primere (poleg kontaktnih zapisov)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"In the process of setting up CiviCRM components or configuring pages and "
"profiles, you might have created test contributions, activities, "
"participants, pledges, etc."
msgstr "V procesu nastavljanja komponent CiviCRM ali nastavljanja strani in profilov, ste morda ustvarili testne prispevke, aktivnosti, udeležence, zastave itd."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Once you have finished your testing, it is a good idea to clean up by "
"finding your test records and deleting them."
msgstr "Ko ste končali testiranje, je dobra ideja, da očistite tako, da najdete svoje zapise testov in jih izbrišete."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Template contributions are used with recurring contribution to generate "
"follow up contributions."
msgstr "Za pripravo nadaljnjih prispevkov se uporabijo prispevki iz predloge s ponavljajočim se prispevkom."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"You can change the template contribution and the changes will occur as soon "
"as new contribution is generated within the recurring series."
msgstr "Spremenite lahko prispevek predloge in spremembe se bodo zgodile takoj, ko se bo ustvaril nov prispevek v ponavljajočih se serijah."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"This is the payment processor's own ID for the recurring contribution. "
"Ideally it should be unique, but in practice may not be."
msgstr "To je lastni ID ponudnika plačilnih storitev za ponavljajoči prispevek. V idealnem primeru bi moral biti edinstven, vendar v praksi morda ne."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Advanced.hlp
msgid ""
"Unique reference for the recurring contribution. May be made up of other "
"fields, e.g. bank ID, account number, etc."
msgstr "Edinstvena referenca za ponavljajoče se prispevke. Lahko so sestavljena iz drugih polj, npr. bančne osebne izkaznice, številke računa itd."

