#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Basic.hlp
msgid ""
"Find contacts by partial or full name or email, type of contact, group, "
"and/or tag. You can then view or edit contact details, print a contact list,"
" or use the <strong>- more actions -</strong> drop down list to assign tags,"
" add contacts to groups, create smart groups, export contact data to a "
"spreadsheet, and more."
msgstr "Poiščite stike po delnem ali polnem imenu ali e-pošti, vrsti stika, skupini in/ali oznaki. Nato si lahko ogledate ali uredite kontaktne podatke, natisnete seznam stikov ali uporabite <strong>- več dejanj -</strong> spusti seznam za dodelitev oznak, dodate stike v skupine, ustvarite pametne skupine, izvozite kontaktne podatke v preglednico in še več."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Basic.hlp
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Advanced Search</strong> to search by address, demographics, "
"custom fields, notes, and/or relationships. If you are using CiviContribute,"
" CiviEvent or CiviMember - you can also search based on information stored "
"by these components. For example - you can find all contacts who live in a "
"specific city AND have contributed at least %1 within the past 6 months."
msgstr "Kliknite <strong>Advanced Search</strong> za iskanje po naslovih, demografiji, po meri polj, opombah in/ali odnosih. Če uporabljate CiviContribute, CiviEvent ali CiviMember - lahko iščete tudi na podlagi podatkov, ki jih te komponente shranijo. Na primer - najdete vse stike, ki živijo v določenem mestu IN so prispevali vsaj %1 v zadnjih 6 mesecih."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Basic.hlp
msgid "Contacts in the <strong>%1</strong> group are listed below."
msgstr "Kontakti v skupini <strong>%1</strong> so navedeni spodaj."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Basic.hlp
msgid "Use 'Find Contacts within this Group' to search for specific contacts."
msgstr "Uporabite \"Poišči stike znotraj te skupine\" za iskanje specifičnih stikov."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Basic.hlp
msgid ""
"Use the 'Group Status...' checkboxes to view contacts with 'Pending' status "
"and/or contacts who have been 'Removed' from this group."
msgstr "Uporabite potrditvena polja » Status skupine... « za ogled stikov s statusom » Pending « in/ali stiki, ki so bili »izvzeti« iz te skupine."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Basic.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this Search form to find contacts. Mark the contacts you want to add to "
"this group. Then click 'Add Contacts to %1'."
msgstr "Uporabite ta iskalni obrazec za iskanje stikov. Označite stike, ki jih želite dodati v to skupino. Nato kliknite 'Dodaj stike na %1'."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Basic.hlp
msgid ""
"Click this button if you want to view and or modify the search criteria used"
" to define the members of this smart group."
msgstr "Kliknite ta gumb, če želite videti in spremeniti kriterije iskanja, ki se uporabljajo za opredelitev članov te pametne skupine."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Basic.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also add contacts to a smart group directly - regardless of whether "
"they meet the smart group search criteria. For example, you might have a "
"smart group for constituents who live in a certain locality, AND might have "
"a few constituents who want to stay informed about events in that locality "
"even though they no longer live there. Click this button to add contacts "
"directly to this smart group."
msgstr "Prav tako lahko neposredno dodate stike v pametno skupino - ne glede na to, ali izpolnjujejo kriterije za iskanje pametnih skupin. Na primer, lahko imate pametno skupino za volivce, ki živijo v določenem kraju, IN morda imajo nekaj komponent, ki želijo ostati obveščeni o dogodkih v tej okolici, čeprav tam ne živijo več. Kliknite ta gumb, da dodate stike neposredno tej pametni skupini."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Builder.hlp
msgid "Search documentation in the User Guide"
msgstr "Iskalna dokumentacija v Priročniku za uporabnika"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Builder.hlp
msgid ""
"Create your search by selecting the criteria (record type and field), the "
"comparison operator, and entering the value you want to search for. You can "
"define one or many criteria as a set: <em>Include contacts where... State IS"
" Washington AND City IS Seattle AND Birth Date is later than (>) Jan 1, "
"1985</em>"
msgstr "Ustvarite iskanje z izbiro kriterijev (vrsta zapisa in polje), operater za primerjavo, in vnos vrednosti, ki jo želite iskati. Lahko opredelite eno ali več meril kot niz: <em>Vključite stike, kjer... Država je Washington in mesto je Seattle in rojstni datum je kasneje kot (>) Jan 1, 1985</em>"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Builder.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also create additional sets of criteria: <em>Also include contacts "
"where... State IS California AND City IS Los Angeles AND Birth Date is later"
" than (>) Jan 1, 1985</em>"
msgstr "Lahko ustvarite tudi dodatne sklope meril: <em>Vključite tudi stike, kjer... Država je Kalifornija in mesto je Los Angeles in datum rojstva je poznejši kot (>) Jan 1, 1985</em>"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Builder.hlp
msgid "For more information see %1."
msgstr "Za več informacij glej %1."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Search/Builder.tpl
msgid ""
"Search Builder is a legacy part of CiviCRM. It is recommended to <a %1>use "
"SearchKit instead</a>."
msgstr "Search Builder je zapuščinski del CiviCRM. Priporočljivo je, da <a %1>use SearchKit namesto </a>."

