#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/Help/Email/id-from_email.hlp
msgid ""
"By default, CiviCRM uses the primary email address of the logged in user as "
"the FROM address when sending emails to contacts. However, users with "
"Administer CiviCRM permission can configure one or more general email "
"addresses that can be selected as an alternative. EXAMPLE: \"Client "
"Services\" &lt;clientservices@example.org&gt;"
msgstr "Privzeto CiviCRM uporablja primarni e-poštni naslov prijavljenega uporabnika kot naslov IZ pri pošiljanju e-pošte stikom. Vendar pa lahko uporabniki z dovoljenjem Administratorja CiviCRM nastavijo enega ali več splošnih e-poštnih naslovov, ki jih je mogoče izbrati kot alternativo. PRIMER: \"Client Services\" &lt;clientservices@example.org&gt;"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/Help/Email/id-from_email.hlp
msgid ""
"CiviCRM is currently configured to only use the defined From Email "
"addresses. If you wish to be able to use the email address of the logged in "
"user as the From Address you will need to set the setting \"Allow mail from "
"logged in contact\" setting. Users with Administer CiviCRM can set this "
"setting in the SMTP settings."
msgstr "CiviCRM je trenutno nastavljen tako, da lahko uporablja le določene Email naslove. Če želite uporabljati e-poštni naslov prijavljenega uporabnika kot From Naslov, boste morali nastaviti nastavitev \"Dovolite pošti iz prijavljenega stika\". Uporabniki z administrativno CiviCRM lahko to nastavitev nastavite v nastavitvah SMTP."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/Help/Email/id-from_email.hlp
msgid ""
"Go to <a href='%1'>Settings - Outbound Mail</a> to enable the usage of the "
"logged in contact's email address as the from email"
msgstr "Pojdi na <a href='%1'>Setings - Izven Mail</a>, da se omogoči uporaba prijavljenega v e-poštni naslov kontakta kot iz e-pošte"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/Help/Email/id-from_email.hlp
msgid ""
"Go to <a href='%1'>Administer CiviCRM &raquo; Communications &raquo; Site "
"From Email Addresses</a> to add or edit general email addresses. Make sure "
"these email addresses are valid email accounts with your email service "
"provider."
msgstr "Pojdi na <a href='%1'>administer CiviCRM &raquo; Communications &raquo; Site From Email addreses</a> za dodajanje ali urejanje splošnih e-poštnih naslovov. Preverite, ali so ti e-poštni naslovi veljavni e-poštni računi pri vašem ponudniku e-pošte."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/Label.hlp
msgid "Select a label format from the dropdown list."
msgstr "Izberite obliko oznake s spustnega seznama."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/Label.hlp
msgid ""
"Go to <strong><a %1>Administer CiviCRM &raquo; Communications &raquo; Label "
"Page Formats</a></strong> to add or edit labels or set the default label "
"format."
msgstr "Pojdi na<strong><a %1>Dajanje zdravila CiviCRM&raquo;Komunikacije&raquo;Oblika strani z oznako</a></strong>dodajanje ali urejanje oznak ali nastavitev privzete oblike oznake."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/Map/Google.tpl
