msgid "By Distance from a Location"
msgstr "Po oddaljenosti od lokacije"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/ProximityCommon.tpl
msgid "FROM..."
msgstr "Od..."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.hlp
msgid ""
"By default, CiviCRM uses the provider which are set active and the default "
"provider is selected. User with administer CiviCRM permission can add a new "
"Provider"
msgstr "Privzeto CiviCRM uporablja ponudnika, ki je nastavljen aktivno in je izbran privzeti ponudnik. Uporabnik z dovoljenjem CiviCRM lahko doda novega Ponudnika"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.hlp
msgid ""
"Go to <a href='%1'>Administer CiviCRM &raquo; System Settings &raquo; SMS "
"Providers</a> to add or edit the provider. Make sure these Providers are "
"valid."
msgstr "Pojdi na <a href='%1'>administer CiviCRM &raquo; Sistemske nastavitve &raquo; SMS Ponudniki </a> za dodajanje ali urejanje ponudnika. Poskrbite, da so ti Ponudniki veljavni."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.hlp
msgid ""
"Use tokens when you are sending sms to a number of recipients, and want to "
"include their name and / or other values from their contact record "
"automatically within your message."
msgstr "Uporabljajte žetone, ko pošiljate sms številnim prejemnikom, in želite v svoje sporočilo samodejno vključiti njihovo ime in / ali druge vrednosti."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.hlp
msgid ""
"You will also use tokens to insert Unsubscribe, Opt out and Forwarding links"
" in your message."
msgstr "Uporabljali boste tudi žetone za vstavljanje Odjavi, Opt out in Posredovanje povezav v svojem sporočilu."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.hlp
msgid ""
"A single SMS message is typically 160 characters in length. If you want to "
"send a message that is longer than 160 characters, it is split into multiple"
" segments."
msgstr "Eno sporočilo SMS je običajno 160 znakov po dolžini. Če želite poslati sporočilo, ki je daljše od 160 znakov, je razdeljeno na več segmentov."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.hlp
msgid "The cost of sending SMS message is typically <em>per segment</em>."
msgstr "Stroški pošiljanja SMS sporočila so običajno <em>per segment</em>."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.hlp
msgid ""
"Certain characters like emoji or curly quotes can shorten the segment size "
"to 96 characters, increasing the cost per message."
msgstr "Nekateri znaki, kot so emoji ali kodraste ponudbe lahko skrajšajo velikost segmenta na 96 znakov, povečanje stroškov na sporočilo."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.tpl
msgid ""
"SMS will NOT be sent to %count contact who has no mobile phone number, who "
"is set to Do not SMS, or who is deceased."
msgid_plural ""
"SMS will NOT be sent to %count contacts who have no mobile phone number, who"
" are set to Do not SMS, or who are deceased."
msgstr[0] "SMS NE bo poslan v stik z %count, ki nima mobilne telefonske številke, ki je nastavljena na Ne SMS, ali ki je umrl."
msgstr[1] "SMS NE bo poslan na %count kontakte, ki nimajo mobilne telefonske številke, ki so nastavljeni na Ne SMS, ali ki so umrli."
msgstr[2] "SMS NE bo poslan na %count kontakte, ki nimajo mobilne telefonske številke, ki so nastavljeni na Ne SMS, ali ki so umrli."
msgstr[3] "SMS NE bo poslan na %count kontakte, ki nimajo mobilne telefonske številke, ki so nastavljeni na Ne SMS, ali ki so umrli."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.tpl
msgid ""
"SMS will NOT be sent to contacts of %count Activity - (there are more than "
"one Target contact)."
msgid_plural ""
"SMS will NOT be sent to contacts of %count Activities - (there are more than"
" one Target contact)."
msgstr[0] "SMS NE bo poslan na stike z %count Activity - (obstaja več kot en stik Target)."
msgstr[1] "SMS NE bo poslan na stike %count dejavnosti - (obstaja več kot en stik Target)."
msgstr[2] "SMS NE bo poslan na stike %count dejavnosti - (obstaja več kot en stik Target)."
msgstr[3] "SMS NE bo poslan na stike %count dejavnosti - (obstaja več kot en stik Target)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.tpl
msgid ""
"SMS will NOT be sent to contacts of %count selected activity as they are "
"invalid for this task action."
msgid_plural ""
"SMS will NOT be sent to contacts of %count selected activities as they are "
"invalid for this task action."
msgstr[0] "SMS NE bo poslan stikom izbrane aktivnosti %count, saj so za to opravilo neveljavni."
msgstr[1] "SMS NE bo poslan stikom izbranih aktivnosti %count, ker so za to opravilo neveljavne."
msgstr[2] "SMS NE bo poslan stikom izbranih aktivnosti %count, ker so za to opravilo neveljavne."
msgstr[3] "SMS NE bo poslan stikom izbranih aktivnosti %count, ker so za to opravilo neveljavne."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.tpl
msgid "SMS will NOT be sent to %count contact."
msgid_plural "SMS will NOT be sent to %count contacts."
msgstr[0] "SMS NE bo poslan v stik z %count."
msgstr[1] "SMS NE bo poslan na stike %count."
msgstr[2] "SMS NE bo poslan na stike %count."
msgstr[3] "SMS NE bo poslan na stike %count."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMS.tpl
msgid "SMS will NOT be sent to contacts of %count selected activity."
msgid_plural "SMS will NOT be sent to contacts of %count selected activities."
msgstr[0] "SMS NE bo poslan stikom izbrane aktivnosti %count."
msgstr[1] "SMS NE bo poslan stikom izbranih aktivnosti %count."
msgstr[2] "SMS NE bo poslan stikom izbranih aktivnosti %count."
msgstr[3] "SMS NE bo poslan stikom izbranih aktivnosti %count."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMSCommon.tpl
msgid ""
"You can insert up to %1 characters. You have entered %2 characters, "
"requiring %3 segments."
msgstr "Vstavite lahko do %1 znakov. Vnesli ste %2 znakov, ki zahtevajo %3 segmentov."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SMSCommon.tpl
msgid "SMS body exceeding limit of %1 characters"
msgstr "Telo SMS, ki presega mejo znakov %1"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SaveSearch.tpl
msgid ""
"This smart group will stay up-to-date with all contacts who meet the search "
"criteria."
msgstr "Ta pametna skupina bo ostala na tekočem z vsemi stiki, ki izpolnjujejo merila za iskanje."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/SaveSearch.tpl
msgid ""
"NOTE: Even if only a few contacts have been selected from the search "
"results, all contacts that meet the following criteria will be in the group."
msgstr "OPOMBA: Tudi če je iz rezultatov iskanja izbranih le nekaj stikov, bodo vsi stiki, ki izpolnjujejo naslednja merila, v skupini."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task/Unhold.tpl
msgid "Are you sure you want to unhold email of selected contact(s)?."
msgstr "Ali ste prepričani, da želite odkleniti e-pošto izbranih stikov?."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task.tpl
msgid "Number of selected contacts: %1"
msgstr "Število izbranih stikov: %1"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task.tpl
msgid "View Selected Contacts"
msgstr "Poglej izbrane stike"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Form/Task.tpl
msgid "Selected Contacts"
msgstr "Izbrani stiki"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/CSV.tpl
msgid "Upload CSV File"
msgstr "Naloži datoteko CSV"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/CSV.tpl
msgid ""
"File format must be comma-separated-values (CSV). File must be UTF8 encoded "
"if it contains special characters (e.g. accented letters, etc.)."
msgstr "Datotečna oblika mora biti ločena od vejice (CSV). Datoteka mora biti UTF8, kodirana, če vsebuje posebne znake (npr. poudarjene črke itd.)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"Select <strong>Individual</strong> for Contact Type if each record in your "
"file represents an individual person - even if the file also contains "
"related Organization data (e.g. Employer Name, Employer Address, etc.)."
msgstr "Izberite <strong>Individual</strong> za vrsto stika, če vsak zapis v vaši datoteki predstavlja posamezno osebo - tudi če datoteka vsebuje tudi povezane podatke organizacije (npr. ime delodajalca, naslov delodajalca itd.)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"Select <strong>Organization</strong> or <strong>Household</strong> if each "
"record in your file represents a contact of that type."
msgstr "Izberi<strong>Organizacija</strong>ali<strong>Gospodinjstvo</strong>če vsak zapis v vaši datoteki predstavlja stik te vrste."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Importing Contact Subtypes</strong> - If your file contains a mix of"
" \"subtypes\" belonging to a built-in type, select the built-in (\"parent\")"
" type here. You will then be able to map a Contact Subtype field from your "
"file which sets the subtype for each row. EXAMPLE: If you are importing a "
"mixture of Individuals who are \"Students\" and \"Parents\" and \"Staff\" "
"subtypes, select \"Individual\" here AND include a column in your import "
"file which contains the subtype for each row."
msgstr "<strong>Importing Contact Subtypes</strong> - Če vaša datoteka vsebuje mešanico \"podvrst\", ki pripadajo vgrajenemu tipu, izberite tukaj vgrajeno (\"starševsko\") vrsto. Potem boste lahko iz vaše datoteke kartografirali polje stika, ki določa podtip za vsako vrstico. PRIMER: Če uvažate mešanico posameznikov, ki so \"učenci\" in \"stari\" in \"Staff\" podtipi, izberite \"posamičen\" tukaj in vključite stolpec v uvozno datoteko, ki vsebuje podtip za vsako vrstico."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"If all records in the file belong to the same subtype, then select that "
"subtype from the \"Subtype\" field. All records will be automatically "
"assigned to that subtype. In this case you do NOT need to include a Subtype "
"column in the file."
msgstr "Če vsi zapisi v datoteki pripadajo istemu podtipu, potem izberite podtip iz polja » Podtip «. Vsi zapisi bodo samodejno dodeljeni temu podtipu. V tem primeru ni treba v datoteko vključiti stolpca podvrste."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"Select a specific Contact Subtype here ONLY if all you want all records in "
"this import to be assigned to that subtype. EXAMPLE: If all records are of "
"the <strong>Student</strong>, select that subtype here and it will be "
"assigned to all import records."
msgstr "Izberite poseben podtip Stik SAMO če želite, da se vsi zapisi v tem uvozu dodelijo temu podtipu. PRIMER: Če so vsi zapisi <strong>Student</strong>, izberite to podtip tukaj in bo dodeljen vsem uvoznim zapisom."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"Do NOT select a Contact Subtype if your import file contains a mixture of "
"subtypes. In that case, select the built-in (\"parent\") type, and make sure"
" you'll file includes include a column which sets the subtype for each row."
msgstr "Ne izberite podvrste stika, če vaša uvozna datoteka vsebuje mešanico podtipov. V tem primeru izberite vgrajeno (\"matično\") vrsto in se prepričajte, da bo datoteka vključevala stolpec, ki določa podtip za vsako vrstico."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"If a contact in the import file appears to be a duplicate of an existing "
"CiviCRM contact..."
msgstr "Če se zdi, da je stik v uvozni datoteki dvojnik obstoječega stika CiviCRM..."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Skip:</strong> Reports and then Skips duplicate import file rows - "
"leaving the matching record in the database as-is (default)."
msgstr "<strong>Skip:</strong> Poročila in nato Preskoči podvojene uvozne datoteke vrstice - pustite ujemanje zapis v bazi podatkov as-je (privzeto)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Update:</strong> Updates database fields with available import data."
" Fields in the database which are NOT included in the import row are left "
"as-is."
msgstr "<strong>Update:</strong> Posodobi podatkovna polja z razpoložljivimi podatki o uvozu. Polja v podatkovni zbirki, ki niso vključena v uvozno vrstico, so ostala as-is."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Fill:</strong> Fills in additional contact data only. Database "
"fields which currently have values are left as-is."
msgstr "<strong>Fill:</strong> Zapolni samo dodatne kontaktne podatke. Polja baze podatkov, ki imajo trenutno vrednosti, so ostala kot-je."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>No Duplicate Checking:</strong> Inserts all valid records without "
"comparing them to existing contact records for possible duplicates."
msgstr "<strong>No Podvojeno preverjanje:</strong> Vstavi vse veljavne zapise brez primerjave z obstoječimi kontaktnimi zapisi za morebitne dvojnike."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"You can only match imported data directly to existing Contact IDs in Update,"
" Fill or No Duplicate Checking modes."
msgstr "Uvožene podatke lahko primerjate le z obstoječimi kontaktnimi ID-ji v načinu za preverjanje posodobitve, izpolnite ali ne."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"Select the source of the imported data. By default the following choices are"
" possible:"
msgstr "Izberite vir uvoženih podatkov. Privzeto so možne naslednje možnosti:"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"A spreadsheet-like file with the contact data in each row. Data fields are "
"separated by commas. You can export to a \"CSV\" file from most spreadsheet "
"applications, many database managers, as well as other contact management "
"and address book applications. Consult the documentation for your "
"application if you're not sure how to do this. Save this file to your local "
"hard drive (or an accessible drive on your network) - and then choose that "
"file as your Import Upload File."
msgstr "Datoteko, podobno tabeli, s kontaktnimi podatki v vsaki vrstici. Podatkovna polja so ločena z vejicami. V datoteko » CSV « lahko izvozite iz večine programov preglednice, številnih upravljalcev podatkovnih zbirk, kakor tudi drugih aplikacij za upravljanje stikov in adresarja. Če niste prepričani, kako to storiti, si oglejte dokumentacijo. Shranite to datoteko na svoj lokalni trdi disk (ali dostopen pogon na vašem omrežju) - in nato izberite to datoteko kot datoteko kot datoteko uvoz upload."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid "A direct SQL query in the form of a SELECT query. For example:"
msgstr "Neposredna poizvedba SQL v obliki poizvedbe SELECT. Na primer:"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"This query can be against a different database, but that database has to be "
"on the same database server and the CiviCRM database user has to have the "
"SELECT privilege (and any other privileges required to execute the query)."
msgstr "Ta poizvedba je lahko proti drugi bazi podatkov, vendar mora biti baza podatkov na istem strežniku podatkovne zbirke in uporabnik zbirke CiviCRM mora imeti privilegij SELECT (in vse druge privilegije, potrebne za izvedbo poizvedbe)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"If you have selected one of the dedupe options besides \"no duplicate "
"checking,\" CiviCRM will use a predefined dedupe rule to determine possible "
"matches for your imported records. Existing dedupe rules may be reviewed, "
"and new rules created, by visiting Contacts > Manage Duplicates."
msgstr "Če ste izbrali eno od možnosti dedupe poleg \"brez podvojenega preverjanja,\" bo CiviCRM uporabil vnaprej določeno pravilo dedupe za določitev možnih ujemanj za vaše uvožene zapise. Obstoječa pravila dedupe se lahko pregleda, in nova pravila, ki jih ustvari z obiskom Kontakti > Upravljanje dvojnikov."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"When selecting a dedupe rule, be sure to choose one that includes fields "
"contained in your import file. Also be aware that the update and fill "
"options could have significant impact on your existing data. You should "
"define and select a rule that is strict enough to ensure there are no false "
"positive matches."
msgstr "Pri izbiri pravila za dedupe se prepričajte, da izberete tisto, ki vključuje polja, vsebovana v uvozni datoteki. Zavedajte se tudi, da bi lahko posodobitev in zapolnitev možnosti pomembno vplivala na vaše obstoječe podatke. Določiti in izbrati morate pravilo, ki je dovolj strogo, da se zagotovi, da ni lažnih pozitivnih ujemanj."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"Enter the character used to separate data columns in your import file. By "
"default, the field will populate with the separator defined in your global "
"settings. Common values include a comma, semicolon, or pipe character. To "
"import a tab separated file, enter \"tab\" (without quotes) in the field."
msgstr "Vnesite znak, ki se uporablja za ločevanje podatkovnih stolpcev v uvozni datoteki. Privzeto se polje zapolni z ločilom, določenim v vaših globalnih nastavitvah. Skupne vrednosti vključujejo znak vejice, podpičja ali cevi. Za uvoz datoteke z ločenim zavihkom vnesite » tab « (brez citatov) v polje."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Mapper.tpl
msgid "Mapper - 4 Selectors"
msgstr "Mapper - 4 selektorji"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Preview.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid "Total number of rows in the imported data."
msgstr "Skupno število vrstic v uvoženih podatkih."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Preview.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid ""
"Rows with invalid data in one or more fields (for example, invalid email "
"address formatting). These rows will be skipped (not imported)."
msgstr "Vrstice z neveljavnimi podatki v enem ali več poljih (na primer neveljavno oblikovanje e- poštnega naslova). Te vrstice bodo preskočile (ne bodo uvožene)."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Preview.tpl
msgid "Add imported records to a new group"
msgstr "Dodaj uvožene zapise v novo skupino"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Preview.tpl
msgid "Create a new tag and assign it to imported records"
msgstr "Ustvari novo značko in jo dodeli uvoženim zapiskom"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/SQL.tpl
msgid "SQL Import"
msgstr "Uvoz SQL"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/SQL.tpl
msgid ""
"SQL Query must be a SELECT query that returns one or more rows of data to be"
" imported. Specify the database name(s) AND table name(s) in the query (e.g."
" \"SELECT * FROM my_database.my_table WHERE date_entered BETWEEN "
"'1999-01-01' AND '2000-07-31'\")."
msgstr "SQL Query mora biti poizvedba SELECT, ki vrne eno ali več vrstic podatkov, ki jih je treba uvoziti. V poizvedbi navedite imena podatkovnih zbirk IN imena tabel (npr. » SELECT * from my database.my table KJE date  ented MED '1999-01-01' IN '2000-07-31')."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid "Import Status: %1"
msgstr "Status uvoza: %1"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid "Continue Entering Data"
msgstr "Nadaljuj vnos podatkov"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid "You can re-use this import configuration <a href=\"%1\">here</a>"
msgstr "To uvozno konfiguracijo <a href=\"%1\">here</a>"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid ""
"CiviCRM has detected mismatched contact ID. This record has not been "
"updated."
msgid_plural ""
"CiviCRM has detected mismatched contact IDs. These records have not been "
"updated."
msgstr[0] "CiviCRM je zaznal neustrezen ID stika. Ta zapis ni bil posodobljen."
msgstr[1] "CiviCRM je zaznal neusklajene kontaktne ID-je. Ti zapisi niso bili posodobljeni."
msgstr[2] "CiviCRM je zaznal neusklajene kontaktne ID-je. Ti zapisi niso bili posodobljeni."
msgstr[3] "CiviCRM je zaznal neusklajene kontaktne ID-je. Ti zapisi niso bili posodobljeni."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid ""
"You can <a href='%1'>Download Mismatched Contacts</a>. You may then correct "
"them, and import the new file with the corrected data."
msgstr "<a href='%1'>Download Napačno ujemanje stikov</a>. Nato jih lahko popravite in uvozite novo datoteko s popravljenimi podatki."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid ""
"CiviCRM has detected invalid data and/or formatting errors in one record. "
"This record has not been imported."
msgid_plural ""
"CiviCRM has detected invalid data and/or formatting errors in %count "
"records. These records have not been imported."
msgstr[0] "CiviCRM je odkril neveljavne podatke in/ali napake pri oblikovanju v enem zapisu. Ta zapis ni bil uvožen."
msgstr[1] "CiviCRM je odkril neveljavne podatke in/ali napake pri oblikovanju v zapisih %count. Ti zapisi niso bili uvoženi."
msgstr[2] "CiviCRM je odkril neveljavne podatke in/ali napake pri oblikovanju v zapisih %count. Ti zapisi niso bili uvoženi."
msgstr[3] "CiviCRM je odkril neveljavne podatke in/ali napake pri oblikovanju v zapisih %count. Ti zapisi niso bili uvoženi."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid ""
"You can <a href='%1'>See the errors</a>. You may then correct them, and re-"
"import with the corrected data."
msgstr "<a href='%1'>Oglejte si napake</a>. Lahko jih popravite in ponovno uvozite s popravljenimi podatki."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Import/Form/Summary.tpl
msgid ""
