msgid "This will refresh the duplicates list. Click OK to proceed."
msgstr "To bo osvežilo seznam dvojnikov. Kliknite V redu za nadaljevanje."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeFind.tpl
msgid "Refresh Duplicates"
msgstr "Osveži podvojene datoteke"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeFind.tpl
msgid "Batch Merge Duplicate Contacts"
msgstr "Paketno spajanje podvojenih stikov"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeFind.tpl
msgid "Batch Merge Selected Duplicates"
msgstr "Serija Združi izbrane podvojene"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeFind.tpl
msgid ""
"This will run the batch merge process on the listed duplicates. The "
"operation will run in safe mode - only records with no direct data conflicts"
" will be merged. Click OK to proceed if you are sure you wish to run this "
"operation."
msgstr "To bo zagnalo postopek združitve serije na navedenih dvojnikih. Operacija bo potekala v varnem načinu - združili se bodo le zapisi brez neposrednih sporov glede podatkov. Kliknite V redu za nadaljevanje, če ste prepričani, da želite zagnati to operacijo."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeFind.tpl
msgid "Batch Merge All Duplicates"
msgstr "Serija Združi vse podvojene"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeFind.tpl
msgid "Flip Selected Duplicates"
msgstr "Zrcali izbrane dvojnike"

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.hlp
msgid ""
"Manage the rules used to identify potentially duplicate contact records. "
"Scan for duplicates using a selected rule and merge duplicate contact data "
"as needed. Click <strong>Edit Rule</strong> to review or modify the rules "
"for each type of contact. You will generally want to maintain both "
"'Supervised' and 'Unsupervised' rules for each contact type."
msgstr "Upravljajte pravila, ki se uporabljajo za identifikacijo potencialno podvojenih kontaktnih zapisov. Za pregled ali spremembo pravil za vsako vrsto stika kliknite na <strong>Edit Rule</strong>. Na splošno boste želeli ohraniti tako pravila » Nadzorovanja « kot » Nenadzorovanja «."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.hlp
msgid ""
"You can configure any number of additional 'General' rules to provide other "
"criteria to scan for possible duplicates. Click <strong>Use Rule</strong> to"
" start a scan."
msgstr "Lahko nastavite katerokoli število dodatnih \"splošnih\" pravil, da bi zagotovili druge kriterije za skeniranje morebitnih dvojnikov. Kliknite <strong>USE Rule</strong> za začetek skeniranja."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.hlp
msgid ""
"Configure up to five fields to evaluate when searching for 'suspected' "
"duplicate contact records. For each field, set a numeric "
"<strong>Weight</strong> which determines the relative importance of a match "
"on that field."
msgstr "Nastavite do pet polj za ocenjevanje med iskanjem 'sumljivih' dvojnih zapisov o stiku. Za vsako polje nastavite številčno<strong>Teža</strong>ki določa relativno pomembnost ujemanja na tem polju."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also set a <strong>Length</strong> value which determines how many "
"characters in the field should be compared."
msgstr "Nastavite lahko tudi <strong>Length</strong> vrednost, ki določa, koliko znakov v polju je treba primerjati."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.hlp
msgid ""
"EXAMPLE: If you set a length of 8 on 'Street Address', then '101 Delaplane "
"Ave.' would match '101 Delaplain St.' because the first 8 characters are the"
" same. If Length is left blank, then the comparison is done on the entire "
"field value."
msgstr "PRIMER: Če nastavite dolžino 8 na 'Ulica naslov', potem '101 Delaplane Ave.' ustreza '101 Delaplain St.', ker je prvih 8 znakov enako. Če je dolžina prazna, potem je primerjava opravljena na celotni vrednosti polja."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.hlp
msgid ""
"You can configure any number of additional 'General' rules to provide other "
"criteria to scan for possible duplicates."
msgstr "Lahko nastavite katero koli število dodatnih \"splošnih\" pravil, da bi zagotovili druga merila za skeniranje morebitnih dvojnikov."

#: templates/CRM/Contact/Page/DedupeRules.tpl
msgid ""
"Manage the rules used to identify potentially duplicate contact records. "
"Scan for duplicates using a selected rule and merge duplicate contact data "
"as needed."
msgstr "Upravljajte pravila, ki se uporabljajo za prepoznavanje potencialno podvojenih zapisov stikov. Iskanje dvojnikov z izbranim pravilom in po potrebi združevanje podvojenih stiknih podatkov."

