#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"You can create new multiple choice options for this field, or select an "
"existing set of options which you've already created for another custom "
"field."
msgstr "Ustvarite lahko nove možnosti za več možnosti izbire za to polje ali pa izberete obstoječi niz možnosti, ki ste jih že ustvarili za drugo polje po meri."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Display in Table controls which columns are included in the listing of "
"custom data records. If your custom data set has a large number of fields, "
"uncheck this box to exclude less important fields from the listing. All "
"fields will still be included when viewing a single record. You may also "
"want to exclude Note type fields from the table listing."
msgstr "Prikaži v Nadzorih tabele, kateri stolpci so vključeni v seznam podatkov po meri. Če ima vaš nabor podatkov po meri veliko število polj, odkljukajte to možnost, da izključite manj pomembna polja iz seznama. Vsa polja bodo še vedno vključena pri ogledu enega zapisa. Morda boste želeli iz seznama tabel izključiti tudi polja vrste Note."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Leave blank for unlimited. This limit is not implemented by all browsers and"
" rich text editors."
msgstr "Pustite prazno za neomejeno. To omejitev ne izvajajo vsi brskalniki in bogati urejevalniki besedil."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Controls the order in which fields are displayed in a group. Lower numbers "
"are displayed ahead of higher numbers."
msgstr "Nadzoruje vrstni red prikazovanja polj v skupini. Spodnje številke so prikazane pred višjimi številkami."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid "If you want to provide a default value for this field, enter it here."
msgstr "Če želite zagotoviti privzeto vrednost za to polje, jo vnesite tukaj."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Do not make custom fields required unless you want to force all users to "
"enter a value anytime they add or edit this type of record. You can always "
"make the field required when used in a specific Profile form."
msgstr "Polja po meri ne zahtevajo, razen če želite prisiliti vse uporabnike, da vnesejo vrednost kadarkoli dodajo ali uredijo to vrsto zapisa. Polje lahko vedno naredite potrebno, če se uporablja v določeni obliki profila."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"If you are planning on using this field in front-end profile, event "
"registration or contribution forms, you should 'Limit List to Group' or "
"configure an 'Advanced Filter'  (so that you do not unintentionally expose "
"your entire set of contacts). Users must have either 'access contact "
"reference fields' OR 'access CiviCRM' permission in order to use contact "
"reference autocomplete fields. You can assign 'access contact reference "
"fields' to the anonymous role if you want un-authenticated visitors to use "
"this field. Use <a href='%1'>Search Preferences - Contact Reference "
"Options</a> to control the fields included in the search results."
msgstr "Če nameravate uporabiti to polje v profilu prednjega konca, prijavnem ali prispevnem obrazcu, morate \"Limit List to group\" ali nastaviti \"Napredni filter\" (da ne bi nenamerno izpostavili svojega celotnega nabora stikov). Uporabniki morajo imeti ali \"referenčna polja za dostop\" ALI \"dostop CiviCRM\" dovoljenje za uporabo kontaktnih referenčnih samodejno zapolnjenih polj. Anonimni vlogi lahko dodelite \"referenčna polja za dostop\", če želite, da se ta polja uporabljajo neavtentirani obiskovalci.<a href='%1'>Možnosti iskanja - Možnosti stika</a>nadzor polj, vključenih v rezultate iskanja."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.tpl
msgid "Filter by Group"
msgstr "Filtriraj po skupini"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"Filter contact search results for this field using Contact get API "
"parameters. EXAMPLE: To list Students in group 3:"
msgstr "Filtriraj rezultate iskanja stikov za to polje z uporabo parametrov Kontakta dobi API. PRIMER: Seznam študentov v skupini 3:"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.tpl
msgid "Filter search results for this field using API-style parameters"
msgstr "Filtriraj rezultate iskanja za to polje s parametri v slogu API"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"EXAMPLE (Contact entity): To list Students in \"Volunteers\" or "
"\"Supporters\" groups:"
msgstr "PRIMER (kontaktni subjekt): Za seznam študentov v skupinah \"Prostovoljcev\" ali \"Podporniki\":"

