msgstr "Pojasnjevalno besedilo je prikazano na obrazcih za nazaj. Na obrazcu je prikazana predhodna pomoč (nad poljem). Pomoč za objavo je prikazana v pop-up - uporabniki kliknejo na balon za pomoč pri ogledu besedila."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.tpl
msgid "View / Edit Multiple Choice Options"
msgstr "Videz / Uredi več možnosti izbire"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"For 'inline' display custom sets, this title will appear as the fieldset "
"legend. If you choose the 'tab' display style (which is available for "
"Contact record custom fields), the title will be used for the navigation "
"tab."
msgstr "Če izberete slog prikaza » tab « (ki je na voljo za polja po meri), bo naslov uporabljen za navigacijski zavihek."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Select 'Inline' to include this set of fields in the main contact Add/Edit "
"form and Contact Summary screens. Select 'Tab' or 'Tab with Table' to create"
" a separate navigation tab for display and editing these values (generally "
"for less frequently accessed and/or larger sets of fields). 'Tab with Table'"
" is recommended for customs data sets which allow multiple records."
msgstr "Izberite » Vnesite «, da se ta niz polj vključi v glavni obrazec add/Edit in zaslone s povzetki stikov. Izberite » Tab « ali » Tab with Table «, da ustvarite ločen navigacijski zavihek za prikaz in urejanje teh vrednosti (na splošno za manj pogosto dostopne in/ali večje nize polj). » Tab with Table « je priporočljivo za carinske podatkovne nize, ki omogočajo več zapisov."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"NOTE: This setting applies only to custom sets used for Contact records "
"(e.g. Individuals, Households, Organizations, or ALL contact types)."
msgstr "OPOMBA: Ta nastavitev velja samo za komplete po meri, ki se uporabljajo za evidence stikov (npr. posamezniki, gospodinjstva, organizacije ali VSE vrste stikov)."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Select the type of record that this set of custom fields is applicable for. "
"You can configure custom data for a specific type of contact (e.g. "
"Individuals but NOT Organizations), ANY type of contact, or other record "
"types such as activities, contributions, memberships and event participants."
msgstr "Izberite vrsto zapisa, za katerega velja ta niz polj po meri. Podatke po meri lahko nastavite za določeno vrsto stikov (npr. posamezniki, ki niso organizacije), katerokoli vrsto stikov ali druge vrste zapisov, kot so dejavnosti, prispevki, članstvo in udeleženci dogodkov."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"EXAMPLE: If you are using CiviEvent, and you want to collect information "
"from people registering for your events, select \"Participants\". If the "
"information is specific to one type of participant (e.g. event volunteers), "
"select \"Participants (role)\" and then select the role (e.g. 'Volunteer')."
msgstr "PRIMER: Če uporabljate zdravilo CiviEvent in želite zbirati podatke od ljudi, ki se registrirajo za vaše dogodke, izberite \"Udeleženci\". Če so podatki specifični za eno vrsto udeležencev (npr. prostovoljci za dogodek), izberite \"Udeleženci (role)\" in nato izberite vlogo (npr. \"prostovoljec\")."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If your site uses Contact Subtypes, you can assign this set of custom fields"
" to a specific subtype (e.g. 'Student'), OR you can select '- Any -' which "
"makes the fields available to contacts of the parent type (e.g. "
"'Individual') as well as to any subtypes."
msgstr "Če vaša spletna stran uporablja Kontaktne podvrste, lahko dodelite ta nabor polj po meri določenemu podtipu (npr. 'študentu'), ALI lahko izberete '- poljubno -', ki omogoča, da so polja na voljo stikom matičnega tipa (npr. 'posamičen') in vsem podtipom."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Checking this box allows you to enter multiple sets of values for a given "
"record."
msgstr "Če izberete to možnost, lahko vnesete več nizov vrednosti za dani zapis."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>EXAMPLE:</strong> When creating a set of custom fields used to "
"collect <strong>Employment History</strong> - you might have fields for Job "
"Title, Start Date, End Date, and Reason for Leaving. Checking the \"multiple"
" records\" box allows you to collect information for multiple jobs."
msgstr "<strong>EXAMPLE:</strong> Ko ustvarjate nabor polj po meri, ki se uporabljajo za zbiranje <strong>Zaposlitvena zgodovina</strong> - morda imate polja za naslov opravila, začetni datum, končni datum in razlog za odhod. Preverjanje \"mnogo zapisov\" polje vam omogoča zbiranje podatkov za več opravil."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also set the maximum number of records which can be recorded per "
"contact. Using the previous example, you might only want data for the three "
"most recent jobs."
msgstr "Nastavite lahko tudi največje število zapisov, ki se lahko zabeležijo na kontakt. Z uporabo prejšnjega primera boste morda želeli le podatke za tri zadnja opravila."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Use the <a href=\"%1\">Multi-value Custom Data Import tool</a> to import "
"data into multiple record custom fields (the parent records should already "
"exist)."
msgstr "Uporabite <a href=\"%1\">Multi vrednost orodje za uvoz podatkov po meri</a> za uvoz podatkov v polja po meri več zapisov (matične evidence bi morale že obstajati)."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want to set a specific limit on the maximum number of records, enter "
"that number. Otherwise leave this field blank."
msgstr "Če želite določiti določeno omejitev največjega števila zapisov, vnesite to številko. V nasprotnem primeru pustite to polje prazno."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Weight controls the order in which custom field sets are presented when "
"there are more than one. Enter a positive or negative integer - lower "
"numbers are displayed ahead of higher numbers."
msgstr "Teža nadzoruje vrstni red, v katerem so prikazane nastavitve polja po meri, ko jih je več. Vnesite pozitivno ali negativno celo število - nižje številke so prikazane pred višjimi številkami."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want only the title for this fieldset to be displayed "
"when the page is initially loaded (fields are hidden)."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, če želite, da se ob začetku nalaganja strani prikaže le naslov za to polje (polja so skrita)."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want only the title for this fieldset to be displayed "
"when the page is initially loaded (fields are hidden) on advanced search."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, če želite, da se pri naprednem iskanju prikaže le naslov za to polje, ko je stran prvotno naložena (polja so skrita)."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want this custom group to be displayed on public forms"
" e.g. Event Information page. Only public custom groups will be included in "
"event receipts."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, če želite, da je ta skupina po meri prikazana na javnih obrazcih, npr. strani z informacijami o dogodkih. V potrdila o dogodkih bodo vključene samo skupine po meri."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid "Explanatory text displayed at the beginning of this sets of fields."
msgstr "Obrazložitveno besedilo, prikazano na začetku teh nizov polj."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.hlp
msgid "Explanatory text displayed below this set of fields."
msgstr "Obrazložitveno besedilo, prikazano pod to vrsto polj."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to set the title, the type of record the fields will be used "
"for, and set-level help. You will then be able to add any number of fields "
"to the set."
msgstr "Uporabite ta obrazec za nastavljanje naslova, vrsto zapisa, za katero se bodo uporabljala polja, in pomoč na ravni nastavitev. Nato boste lahko dodali poljubno število polj."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.tpl
msgid "Custom Fields for this Set"
msgstr "Poljubna polja za ta nabor"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Group.tpl
msgid ""
"Warning: You have chosen to remove one or more subtypes. This will cause any"
" custom data records associated with those subtypes to be removed as long as"
" the contact does not have a contact subtype still selected."
msgstr "Opozorilo: Odločili ste se, da boste odstranili eno ali več podtipov. To bo povzročilo, da bodo vsi osebni podatki, povezani s temi podtipi, odstranjeni, dokler stik nima še vedno izbranega kontaktnega podtipa."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/MoveField.tpl
msgid "Select a different Custom Data Set for this field."
msgstr "Izberite drug nabor podatkov po meri za to polje."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Option.tpl
msgid "View Option"
msgstr "Možnost prikaza"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Option.tpl
msgid "Delete Option \"%1\""
msgstr "Izbriši možnost \"%1\""

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Option.tpl templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Option.tpl
msgid "Add Option"
msgstr "Dodaj možnost"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Option.tpl
msgid ""
"WARNING: Deleting this custom field option will result in the loss of all "
"related data."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Izbris te možnosti po meri povzroči izgubo vseh povezanih podatkov."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Option.tpl
msgid "Make this option value 'selected' by default?"
msgstr "Naj postane ta vrednost možnosti privzeto 'izbrana'?"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Optionfields.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Field.tpl
msgid "Multiple Choice Options"
msgstr "Možnosti z več izbirami"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Optionfields.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter up to ten (10) multiple choice options in this table (click 'another "
"choice' for each additional choice). If you need more than ten options, you "
"can create an unlimited number of additional choices using the Edit Multiple"
" Choice Options link after saving this new field. If desired, you can mark "
"one of the choices as the default choice. The option 'label' is displayed on"
" the form, while the option 'value' is stored in the contact record. The "
"label and value may be the same or different. Inactive options are hidden "
"when the field is presented."
msgstr "V to tabelo vnesite do deset (10) možnosti izbire (kliknite » drugo izbiro « za vsako dodatno izbiro). Če potrebujete več kot deset možnosti, lahko ustvarite neomejeno število dodatnih možnosti z uporabo povezave Uredi več možnosti izbire po tem, ko shranite to novo polje. Če želite, lahko eno od možnosti označite kot privzeto izbiro. Možnost » označevanje « je prikazana na obrazcu, medtem ko je možnost » vrednost « shranjena v zapisu stikov. Oznaka in vrednost sta lahko enaki ali različni. Neaktivne možnosti so skrite, ko je polje predstavljeno."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Optionfields.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/OptionFields.tpl
msgid "hide field or section"
msgstr "skrij polje ali oddelek"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Optionfields.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/OptionFields.tpl
msgid "add another choice"
msgstr "dodaj drugo izbiro"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Optionfields.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/OptionFields.tpl
msgid ""
"If you need additional options - you can add them after you Save your "
"current entries."
msgstr "Če potrebujete dodatne možnosti - jih lahko dodate po tem, ko shranite trenutne vnose."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Preview.tpl templates/CRM/Price/Form/Preview.tpl
msgid "Preview Mode"
msgstr "Način ogleda"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Preview.tpl
msgid ""
"Showing the custom data group (fieldset) as it will be displayed within an "
"edit form."
msgstr "Prikaz skupine podatkov po meri (nastavljeno polje), ker bo prikazana v urejevalnem obrazcu."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Preview.tpl
msgid "Showing this field as it will be displayed in an edit form."
msgstr "Prikaz tega polja, kot bo prikazano v urejevalni obliki."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Import/Form/DataSource.hlp
msgid ""
"The import file should contain a row for each set of custom data fields. For"
" example, if you are importing employment history for a group of contacts, "
"each row might contain columns for Employer, Start Date, End Date, and "
"Position. You will also need a column containing the CiviCRM Contact ID "
"which is used to match each row to the corresponding (existing) CiviCRM "
"contact record. NOTE: Contact IDs are included by default when exporting "
"contacts from CiviCRM."
msgstr "Uvozna datoteka mora vsebovati vrstico za vsak niz podatkovnih polj po meri. Če na primer uvažate zgodovino zaposlitve za skupino stikov, lahko vsaka vrstica vsebuje stolpce za Delodajalec, datum začetka, končni datum in položaj. Potrebovali boste tudi stolpec, ki vsebuje ID za stike CiviCRM, ki se uporablja za ujemanje vsake vrstice z ustreznim (obstoječim) kontaktnim zapisom CiviCRM. OPOMBA: Kontaktni IDi so privzeto vključeni pri izvozu stikov iz CiviCRM."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Field.tpl templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.tpl
msgid "Req?"
msgstr "Req?"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Field.tpl
msgid "Add Custom Field"
msgstr "Dodaj po meri polje"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Group.tpl
msgid ""
"Custom data is stored in custom fields. Custom fields are organized into "
"logically related custom data sets (e.g. Volunteer Info). Use custom fields "
"to collect and store custom data which are not included in the standard "
"CiviCRM forms. You can create one or many sets of custom fields."
msgstr "Podatki po meri so shranjeni v poljih po meri. Polja po meri so organizirana v logično povezane podatkovne nize po meri (npr. Prostovoljni podatki). Uporabite polja po meri za zbiranje in shranjevanje podatkov po meri, ki niso vključeni v standardne obrazce CiviCRM. Ustvarite lahko enega ali več nizov polj po meri."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Group.tpl
msgid "Set"
msgstr "Nastavi"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Group.tpl
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Stil"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Group.tpl
msgid "All Contact Types"
msgstr "Vse vrste stikov"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Group.tpl
msgid ""
"No custom data groups have been created yet. You can <a "
"id=\"newCustomDataGroup\" href='%1'>add one</a>."
msgstr "Po meri še ni ustvarjenih skupin podatkov. <a id=\"newCustomDataGroup\" href='%1'>addd one</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Option.tpl
msgid ""
"These Multiple Choice Options are shared by the following custom fields: %1"
msgstr "Te več možnosti izbire so deljena z naslednjimi po meri: %1"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Option.tpl
msgid "Processing..."
msgstr "Obdelava..."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Option.tpl
msgid "Show _MENU_ entries"
msgstr "Prikaži vnose _MENU_"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Option.tpl
msgid "Showing _START_ to _END_ of _TOTAL_ entries"
msgstr "Prikaz _START_ na _END_ vnosov _TOTAL_"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Page/Option.tpl
msgid "Alphabetize Options"
msgstr "Možnosti za abecedo"

#: templates/CRM/Dashlet/Page/AllCases.tpl
msgid ""
"There are no Cases. Use <a href=\"%1\">Find Cases</a> to expand your search."
msgstr "Ni primerov. Uporabite <a href=\"%1\">Find Cases</a> za razširitev iskanja."

#: templates/CRM/Dashlet/Page/Blog.tpl
msgid "read more"
msgstr "preberi več"

#: templates/CRM/Dashlet/Page/CaseDashboard.tpl
msgid "New Case"
msgstr "Nov primer"

#: templates/CRM/Dashlet/Page/CaseDashboard.tpl
msgid "Show ALL Cases with Upcoming Activities"
msgstr "Prikaži vse primere s prihajajočimi dejavnostmi"

#: templates/CRM/Dashlet/Page/CaseDashboard.tpl
msgid "Show My Cases with Upcoming Activities"
msgstr "Prikaži moje primere s prihajajočimi dejavnostmi"

#: templates/CRM/Dashlet/Page/CaseDashboard.tpl
msgid "Show My Cases"
msgstr "Pokaži moje primere"

#: templates/CRM/Dashlet/Page/CaseDashboard.tpl
msgid "Summary of Involvement"
msgstr "Povzetek sodelovanja"

#: templates/CRM/Dashlet/Page/MyCases.tpl
msgid ""
"There are no open cases with activities scheduled in the next two weeks. Use"
" <a href=\"%1\">Find Cases</a> to expand your search."
msgstr "Ni odprtih primerov z dejavnostmi, načrtovanimi v naslednjih dveh tednih. Uporabite <a href=\"%1\">Find Cases</a> za razširitev iskanja."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Map.tpl
msgid ""
"Select the fields to be exported using the table below. You'll see a live "
"preview of the first few records for each field."
msgstr "Izberite polja za izvoz z uporabo spodnje tabele. V živo boste videli ogled prvih nekaj zapisov za vsako polje."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Map.tpl
msgid ""
"Your export can include multiple types of contacts, and non-applicable "
"fields will be empty (e.g. <strong>Last Name</strong> will not be populated "
"for an Organization record)."
msgstr "Vaš izvoz lahko vključuje več vrst stikov, in neveljavna polja bodo prazna (npr. <strong>Last Name</strong> ne bo naseljena za zapis organizacije)."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Map.tpl
msgid ""
"If you want to use the same export setup in the future, check 'Save Fields' "
"at the bottom of the page before continuing. You will then be able to reload"
" this setup with a single click."
msgstr "Če želite uporabiti iste izvozne nastavitve v prihodnosti, pred nadaljevanjem preverite 'Shrani polja' na dnu strani. Nato boste lahko ponovno naložili to nastavitev z enim klikom."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Select.hlp
msgid ""
"Use one of the merge contact options when exporting records to reduce your "
"mailing size by sending a single piece of mail to each address."
msgstr "Pri izvozu zapisov uporabite eno od možnosti za združevanje, da zmanjšate velikost pošte tako, da na vsak naslov pošljete en kos pošte."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Select.hlp
msgid ""
"Merge Contacts with the Same Address will combine any records having the "
"same address (street address, city, postal code, country) into a single "
"record. If a household record already exists in which multiple individuals "
"share an address, the household will be exported as the combined record. If "
"no household record exists, the records will be combined and the Addressee "
"field will list the contact names, comma-separated."
msgstr "Združevanje stikov z istim naslovom bo združilo vse zapise, ki imajo isti naslov (ulica, mesto, poštna številka, država) v en sam zapis. Če že obstaja domači zapis, v katerem si več posameznikov deli naslov, bo gospodinjstvo izvoženo kot kombinirani zapis. Če ne obstaja domači zapis, bodo zapisi združeni in polje naslovnika bo seznam kontaktnih imen, vejica ločena."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Select.hlp
msgid ""
"Merge Household Members into their Households will export the household "
"record for any contacts sharing a household address."
msgstr "Združite gospodinjske člane v svoja gospodinjstva bo izvoz gospodinjski zapis za vse stike, ki delijo gospodinjski naslov."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Select.tpl
msgid ""
"<strong>Export PRIMARY fields</strong> provides the most commonly used data "
"values. This includes primary address information, preferred phone and "
"email."
msgstr "<strong>Izvozi PRIMARNA polja</strong> nudi najbolj pogosto uporabljene vrednosti podatkov. To vključuje podatke o primarnem naslovu, preferenčni telefon in e-pošto."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Select.tpl
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Select fields for export</strong> and then "
"<strong>Continue</strong> to choose a subset of fields for export. This "
"option allows you to export multiple specific locations (Home, Work, etc.) "
"as well as custom data. You can also save your selections as a 'field "
"mapping' so you can use it again later."
msgstr "Klik<strong>Izberite polja za izvoz</strong>in potem<strong>Nadaljuj</strong>Če želite izbrati podskupino polj za izvoz. Ta možnost vam omogoča izvoz več posebnih lokacij (domači, delovni, itd.) kot tudi podatkov po meri. Izbiro lahko shranite tudi kot 'poljsko kartiranje', tako da jo lahko kasneje ponovno uporabite."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Select.tpl
msgid "One record selected for export."
msgid_plural "%count records selected for export."
msgstr[0] "En zapis izbran za izvoz."
msgstr[1] "%count zapisi izbrani za izvoz."
msgstr[2] "%count zapisi izbrani za izvoz."
msgstr[3] "%count zapisi izbrani za izvoz."

#: templates/CRM/Export/Form/Select.tpl
msgid ""
"Exclude contacts with \"do not mail\" privacy, no street address, or who are"
" deceased."
msgstr "Izključuje stike z zasebnostjo \"ne po pošti\", brez naslova ulice ali umrlih."

#: templates/CRM/Form/attachment.tpl
msgid "Current Attachment(s)"
msgstr "Trenutne priponke"

#: templates/CRM/Form/attachment.tpl
msgid "Include a Picture or an Image"
msgstr "Vključi sliko ali podobo"

#: templates/CRM/Form/attachment.tpl
msgid ""
"You can upload a picture or image to include on your page. Your file should "
"be in .jpg, .gif, or .png format. Recommended image size is 250 x 250 "
"pixels. Images over 360 pixels wide will be automatically resized to fit."
msgstr "Na vašo stran lahko naložite sliko ali sliko. Datoteka naj bo v .jpg, .gif ali .png formatu. Priporočena velikost slike je 250 x 250 pikslov. Slike, ki so široke več kot 360 pik, bodo samodejno preštevilčene."

#: templates/CRM/Form/attachment.tpl
msgid "File 1 description"
msgstr "Opis datoteke 1"

#: templates/CRM/Form/attachment.tpl
msgid "You can have a maximum of %1 attachment(s)."
msgstr "Lahko imate največ %1 priponk."

#: templates/CRM/Form/attachment.tpl
msgid ""
"Each file must be less than %1M in size. You can also add a short "
"description."
msgstr "Vsaka datoteka mora biti manjša od velikosti %1M. Dodate lahko tudi kratek opis."

#: templates/CRM/Form/attachment.tpl
msgid "Attach File %1"
msgstr "Priloži datoteko %1"

#: templates/CRM/Form/attachment.tpl
msgid "File %1 description"
msgstr "Opis datoteke %1"

#: templates/CRM/Form/attachmentjs.tpl
msgid ""
"This will immediately delete the file %1. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "To bo takoj zbrisalo datoteko %1. Tega dejanja ni mogoče razveljaviti."

#: templates/CRM/Form/body.tpl
msgid "Please correct the following errors in the form fields below:"
msgstr "Prosimo popravite napake v spodnjem obrazcu:"

#: templates/CRM/Friend/Form/Friend.tpl
msgid ""
"Tell a Friend gives your contributors an easy way to spread the word about "
"this fundraising campaign. The contribution thank-you page will include a "
"link to a form where they can enter their friends' email addresses, along "
"with a personalized message. CiviCRM will record these solicitation "
"activities, and will add the friends to your database."
msgstr "Povejte prijatelju, da vaš prispevajoči na enostaven način, da širijo besedo o tej kampanji zbiranja sredstev. Prispevek hvala stran bo vključevala povezavo do obrazca, kjer lahko vnesejo svoje prijatelje e-naslove, skupaj z osebnim sporočilom. CiviCRM bo zabeležil te dejavnosti nagovarjanja, in bo dodal prijatelje v vašo bazo podatkov."

#: templates/CRM/Friend/Form/Friend.tpl
msgid ""
"Tell a Friend gives registering participants an easy way to spread the word "
"about this event. The registration thank-you page will include a link to a "
"form where they can enter their friends' email addresses, along with a "
"personalized message. CiviCRM will record these solicitation activities, and"
" will add the friends to your database."
msgstr "Povejte prijatelju, da registracijo udeležencev enostaven način za širjenje besede o tem dogodku. Registracija zahvalna stran bo vključevala povezavo do obrazca, kjer lahko vnesejo svoje prijatelje e-naslove, skupaj z osebnim sporočilom. CiviCRM bo zabeležil te dejavnosti nagovarjanja, in bo dodal prijatelje v vašo bazo podatkov."

#: templates/CRM/Friend/Form/Friend.tpl
msgid ""
"Tell a Friend gives registering pledge signers an easy way to spread the "
"word about this pledge. The registration thank-you page will include a link "
"to a form where they can enter their friends' email addresses, along with a "
"personalized message. CiviCRM will record these solicitation activities, and"
" will add the friends to your database."
msgstr "Povejte prijatelju daje registracijo podpisniki zastave enostaven način za širjenje besede o tej zastavi. Registracija zahvalna stran bo vključevala povezavo do obrazca, kjer lahko vnesejo svoje prijatelje e-poštnih naslovov, skupaj z osebnim sporočilom. CiviCRM bo zabeležil te dejavnosti nagovarjanja, in bo dodal prijatelje v vašo bazo podatkov."

#: templates/CRM/Friend/Form/Friend.tpl
msgid ""
"If sharing through social media is enabled, links allowing people to share "
"with their social network will also be included on the Tell a Friend form "
"(e.g. Facebook \"Like\" and Twitter). You can turn social media sharing on "
"and off from the Settings tab."
msgstr "Če je omogočena souporaba prek družbenih medijev, bodo na obrazec Tell a Friend (npr. Facebook \"Like\" in Twitter) vključene tudi povezave, ki omogočajo souporaba družbenih medijev."

#: templates/CRM/Friend/Form/Friend.tpl
msgid ""
"A link to this %1 is automatically included in the email sent to friends. If"
" you ALSO want to include a link providing general information about your "
"organization, enter that link here (e.g <em>http://www.example.org/</em>)"
msgstr "Povezava do tega %1 je samodejno vključena v e-pošto, poslano prijateljem. Če želite TUDI vključiti povezavo, ki zagotavlja splošne informacije o vaši organizaciji, vnesite to povezavo tukaj (npr. <em>http://www.example.org/</em>)"

#: templates/CRM/Friend/Form.tpl
msgid ""
"Spread the word about this fundraising page (%1). Add your personal message "
"below. A link to the fundraising page will be automatically included in the "
"email."
msgstr "Razširite besedo o tej strani za zbiranje sredstev (%1). Dodajte svoje osebno sporočilo spodaj. Povezava do strani za zbiranje sredstev bo samodejno vključena v e-pošto."

#: templates/CRM/Friend/Form.tpl
msgid "Send to these Friend(s)"
msgstr "Pošlji tem prijateljem"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Delete.tpl
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the group %1?"
msgstr "Ste prepričani, da želite zbrisati skupino %1?"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Delete.tpl
msgid "This group currently has one member in it."
msgid_plural "This group currently has %count members in it."
msgstr[0] "Ta skupina ima trenutno enega člana."
msgstr[1] "Ta skupina ima trenutno v njej člane %count."
msgstr[2] "Ta skupina ima trenutno v njej člane %count."
msgstr[3] "Ta skupina ima trenutno v njej člane %count."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Delete.tpl
msgid ""
"Deleting this group will NOT delete the member contact records. However, all"
" contact subscription information and history for this group will be "
"deleted."
msgstr "Brisanje te skupine NE bo izbrisalo podatkov o stikih članov. Vendar pa bodo vsi podatki o vpisu in zgodovina stikov za to skupino izbrisani."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Delete.tpl
msgid "If this group is used in CiviCRM profiles, those fields will be reset."
msgstr "Če se ta skupina uporablja v profilih CiviCRM, se ta polja ponastavijo."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Delete.tpl
msgid "WARNING - This Group is currently referenced by %1 smart group(s)."
msgstr "OPOZORILO - To skupino trenutno navaja %1 pametne skupine."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Delete.tpl
msgid ""
"Deleting this group will mean the following Smart Groups will no longer "
"restrict based on membership in this group - as they do currently. Please "
"edit and resave these smart groups to remove reference to this group before "
"deleting."
msgstr "Izbris te skupine pomeni, da naslednje skupine Smart ne bodo več omejevale na podlagi članstva v tej skupini - kot to počnejo trenutno. Prosim, uredite in shranite te pametne skupine, da se pred izbrisom odstranijo reference na to skupino."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Delete.tpl
msgid ""
"%2 <a class='action-item crm-hover-button' href=\"%1\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Edit Smart Group Criteria</a>"
msgstr "%2 <a class='action-item crm-hover-button' href=\"%1\" target=\"_blank\">Edit Pametna skupinska merila</a>"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Edit.tpl
msgid ""
"You can edit the Name and Description for this group here. Click <a "
"%1>Contacts in this Group</a> to view, add or remove contacts in this group."
msgstr "Ime in opis za to skupino lahko uredite tukaj. Kliknite <a %1>Kontakti v tej skupini</a> za ogled, dodajanje ali odstranjevanje stikov v tej skupini."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Edit.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter a unique name and a description for your new group here. Then click "
"'Continue' to find contacts to add to your new group."
msgstr "Tu vnesite edinstveno ime in opis za novo skupino. Nato kliknite »Nadaljuj«, da poiščete stike, ki jih želite dodati v novo skupino."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Edit.tpl
msgid ""
"If reserved, only users with 'administer reserved groups' permission can "
"disable, delete, or change settings for this group. The reserved flag does "
"NOT affect users ability to add or remove contacts from a group."
msgstr "Če je rezervirano, lahko samo uporabniki z dovoljenjem » Administrate reserved groups« onemogočijo, izbrišejo ali spremenijo nastavitve za to skupino. Pridržana zastavica NE vpliva na zmožnost uporabnikov za dodajanje ali odstranjevanje stikov iz skupine."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Edit.tpl
msgid "Contacts in this Group"
msgstr "Kontakti v tej skupini"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Edit.tpl
msgid "Edit Smart Group Criteria"
msgstr "Uredi kriterije pametne skupine"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/GroupsCommon.tpl
msgid "Associated Organization"
msgstr "Povezana organizacija"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Search.tpl
msgid "Find Groups"
msgstr "Najdi skupine"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Search.tpl
msgid "Update Smart Group Counts"
msgstr "Posodobi številke pametnih skupin"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Search.tpl
msgid "Count"
msgstr "Število"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Search.tpl
msgid "<div class=\"status messages\">None found."
msgstr "<div class=\"status messages\">None najden."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Search.tpl
msgid "show child groups"
msgstr "prikaži podskupine"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Search.tpl
msgid "No matching Groups found for your search criteria. Suggestions:"
msgstr "Nobena skupina se ne ujema z vašimi kriteriji iskanja. Predlogi:"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Search.tpl
msgid "Check your spelling."
msgstr "Preveri črkovanje."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Search.tpl
msgid "Try a different spelling or use fewer letters."
msgstr "Poskusite z drugačnim črkovanjem ali uporabite manj črk."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Form/Search.tpl
msgid "hide child groups"
msgstr "skrij podskupine"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Use Groups to organize contacts (e.g. these contacts are part of our "
"'Steering Committee'). You can also create <strong>smart groups</strong> "
"based on contact characteristics (e.g. this group consists of all people in "
"our database who live in a specific locality)."
msgstr "Uporabite skupine za organiziranje stikov (npr. ti stiki so del našega \"Uvrščenega odbora\"). Ustvarite lahko tudi <strong>smart skupine</strong> na podlagi kontaktnih značilnosti (npr. ta skupina je sestavljena iz vseh ljudi v naši bazi podatkov, ki živijo v določenem kraju)."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"You can add contacts to a group from any set of search results (or when "
"viewing an individual contact). You can also allow contacts to sign "
"themselves up for certain groups by setting the group visibility to 'Public "
"Pages' (use the <strong>Settings</strong> link), and including the "
"<strong>Groups</strong> element in your CiviCRM Profile."
msgstr "Lahko dodate stike v skupino iz katerega koli niza rezultatov iskanja (ali pri ogledu posameznega stika). Prav tako lahko dovolite stikom, da se prijavijo za določene skupine z nastavitvijo vidnosti skupine v 'Javni strani' (uporabite <strong>Settings</strong> povezavo), in vključno z <strong>Groups</strong> element v vašem profilu CiviCRM."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Groups which are used as mailing lists should be assigned the 'Mailing List'"
" type."
msgstr "Skupinam, ki se uporabljajo kot poštni seznami, je treba dodeliti vrsto „Mailing List“."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Groups of contacts which are used for <strong>access control</strong> must "
"be assigned that type."
msgstr "Skupine stikov, ki se uporabljajo za <strong>Access control</strong>, morajo biti dodeljene temu tipu."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Use <strong>Find Groups</strong> to search by group name, type and "
"visibility."
msgstr "Uporabite <strong>Find Groups</strong> za iskanje po imenu skupine, vrsti in vidljivosti."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Group type filtering uses <strong>AND</strong> logic. If you check both "
"'Mailing List' and 'Access Control' types - only groups which have both "
"types assigned will be returned."
msgstr "Filtriranje tipa skupine uporablja <strong>AND</strong> logika. Če preverite tako tipe 'Mailing List' kot 'Access Control', bodo vrnjene samo skupine, ki imajo obe dodeljeni vrsti."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also click a letter on the <strong>A-to-Z bar</strong> to quickly "
"find all groups starting with that letter."
msgstr "Prav tako lahko kliknete črko na <strong>A-to-Z bar</strong>, da bi hitro našli vse skupine, začenši s to črko."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check 'Access Control' if you want to use this group to assign access "
"permissions to a set of contacts. %1"
msgstr "Izberite » Nadzor dostopa «, če želite uporabiti to skupino za dodelitev dovoljenj za dostop nizu stikov. %1"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check 'Mailing List' if you are using this group as a mailing list in the "
"%1."
msgstr "Če uporabljate to skupino kot dopisni seznam v %1, preverite » Mailing List «."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Select 'User and User Admin Only' if joining this group is controlled by "
"authorized CiviCRM users only. If you want to allow contacts to join and "
"remove themselves from this group via the Registration and Account Profile "
"forms, select 'Public Pages'."
msgstr "Izberite samo » Uporabnik in uporabniški skrbnik «, če se pridružite tej skupini, ki jo nadzorujejo samo pooblaščeni uporabniki CiviCRM. Če želite omogočiti stikom, da se pridružijo in se iz te skupine odstranijo preko obrazcev Registracija in profil računa, izberite »Javne strani«."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Some organizations find it useful to create a hierarchy of groups. In "
"CiviCRM, this is done by creating one or more \"Parent\" groups and then "
"assigning other groups to them. When a user sends a mailing to a \"Parent\","
" or searches for contacts in a \"Parent\" - all contacts in the associated "
"child groups are automatically included."
msgstr "Nekatere organizacije menijo, da je koristno ustvariti hierarhijo skupin. V CiviCRM, to se naredi tako, da ustvarite eno ali več \"Staršev\" skupin in nato dodeli druge skupine, da jih. Ko uporabnik pošlje pošto na \"Parent\", ali išče stike v \"Parent\" - vsi stiki v povezanih skupin otrok so samodejno vključeni."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"EXAMPLE: An organization that has a National office and 5 regional offices "
"puts constituents in each region into their own group. Then they create a "
"\"National\" group which is assigned as the \"Parent\" for all regional "
"groups. The National office can now send mailings (for example) to the "
"\"National\" group - knowing that all contacts in the regional groups will "
"be included."
msgstr "PRIMER: Organizacija, ki ima nacionalni urad in 5 regionalnih uradov, postavlja volivce v vsako regijo v svojo skupino. Nato ustanovijo »Nacionalno« skupino, ki je dodeljena kot »Parent« za vse regionalne skupine. Nacionalni urad lahko zdaj pošlje sporočila (na primer) skupini »Nacional« - vedoč, da bodo vključeni vsi stiki v regionalnih skupinah."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Some organizations find it useful to be able to connect Organization "
"contacts to Groups (one-to-one relationship) to represent a multi-org "
"hierarchy. The org contact holds info about the org itself (name, location, "
"etc.) and the group holds other sub-groups/contacts related to that group "
"(employees, alumni, online activists, members, etc.)."
msgstr "Nekatere organizacije menijo, da je koristno povezati stike organizacije s skupinami (od enega do enega odnosa), da bi predstavljale večorg hierarhijo. Org kontakt ima informacije o sami orgi (ime, lokacija itd.) in skupina ima druge podskupine/kontakte, povezane s to skupino (zaposleni, diplomanti, spletni aktivisti, člani itd.)."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Update this page with current statistics on the number of contacts in each "
"smart group."
msgstr "Posodobite to stran s trenutno statistiko o številu stikov v vsaki pametni skupini."

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.hlp
msgid "CiviMail component"
msgstr "CiviMail komponenta"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.tpl
msgid "Add Group"
msgstr "Dodaj skupino"

#: templates/CRM/Group/Page/Group.tpl
msgid ""
"Use Groups to organize contacts (e.g. these contacts are part of our "
"'Steering Committee'). You can also create 'smart' groups based on contact "
"characteristics (e.g. this group consists of all people in our database who "
"live in a specific locality)."
msgstr "Uporabljajte skupine za organiziranje stikov (npr. ti stiki so del našega \"Ustrajevalnega odbora\"). Prav tako lahko ustvarite \"pametne\" skupine na podlagi kontaktnih značilnosti (npr. ta skupina je sestavljena iz vseh ljudi v naši bazi podatkov, ki živijo v določenem kraju)."

#: templates/CRM/Import/Form/DataSource.tpl
msgid ""
"Select 'Individual' if you are importing %1 made by individual persons."
msgstr "Izberite »Individualno«, če uvažate %1, ki ga izdelajo posamezne osebe."

#: templates/CRM/Import/Form/DataSource.tpl
msgid ""
"Select 'Organization' or 'Household' if you are importing %1 to contacts of "
"that type."
msgstr "Izberite 'Organizacija' ali 'Household', če uvažate %1 v stike te vrste."

#: templates/CRM/Import/Form/DataSource.tpl
msgid ""
"This option is not recommended for large imports. Use the command-line "
"geocoding script instead."
msgstr "Ta možnost ni priporočljiva za velike uvoze. Uporabite ukazno vrstico za geokodiranje."

#: templates/CRM/Import/Form/DataSource.tpl
msgid "Uncheck at your own risk as batch processing violates USPS API TOS."
msgstr "Uncheck na lastno tveganje, kot serijska obdelava krši USPS API TOS."

#: templates/CRM/Import/Form/DataSource.tpl
msgid "select"
msgstr "izberi"

