#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/DeleteField.tpl
msgid ""
"WARNING: Deleting this price field will result in the loss of all '%1' data."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Brisanje tega cenovnega polja bo povzročilo izgubo vseh podatkov '%1'."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/DeleteSet.tpl
msgid ""
"WARNING: Deleting this price set will result in the loss of all '%1' data."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Brisanje tega nabora cen bo povzročilo izgubo vseh podatkov '%1'."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter a value here if you want to increment the number of registered "
"participants per unit against the maximum number of participants allowed for"
" this event."
msgstr "Tu vnesite vrednost, če želite povečati število prijavljenih udeležencev na enoto glede na največje dovoljeno število udeležencev na tem dogodku."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"There is no Financial Type configured of Account Relation Revenue. <a "
"href='%1'>Click here</a> if you want to configure financial type for your "
"site."
msgstr "<a href='%1'>Kliknite tukaj</a>, če želite nastaviti finančno vrsto za vašo spletno stran."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Field.tpl
msgid "Display amount next to each option?"
msgstr "Prikaz zneska ob vsaki možnosti?"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"Weight controls the order in which fields are displayed in a group. Enter a "
"positive or negative integer - lower numbers are displayed ahead of higher "
"numbers."
msgstr "Teža nadzoruje vrstni red prikazovanja polj v skupini. Vnesite pozitivno ali negativno celo število - nižje številke so prikazane pred višjimi številkami."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Field.tpl
msgid "Explanatory text displayed to users at the beginning of this field."
msgstr "Obrazložitveno besedilo, prikazano uporabnikom na začetku tega polja."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Field.tpl
msgid "Explanatory text displayed to users below this field."
msgstr "Obrazložitveno besedilo, prikazano uporabnikom pod tem poljem."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"Date this field becomes effective (optional).  Used for price set fields "
"that are made available starting on a specific date."
msgstr "Datum, ko to polje postane učinkovito (neobvezno). Uporablja se za polja, ki so na voljo na določen datum."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"Date this field expires (optional).  Used for price set fields that are no "
"longer available after a specific date (e.g. early-bird pricing)."
msgstr "Datum, ko se to polje izteče (neobvezno). Uporablja se za polja s ceno, ki po določenem datumu niso več na voljo (npr. določanje cen zgodnjih ptic)."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Option.tpl
msgid "WARNING: Deleting this option will result in the loss of all data."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Izbris te možnosti bo povzročil izgubo vseh podatkov."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Option.tpl
msgid ""
"If a membership type is selected, a membership will be created or renewed "
"when users select this option. Leave this blank if you are using this for "
"non-membership options (e.g. magazine subscription)."
msgstr "Če je izbrana vrsta članstva, bo članstvo ustvarjeno ali obnovljeno, ko bodo uporabniki izbrali to možnost. Pustite to prazno, če uporabljate to možnost za nečlanske možnosti (npr. naročnina na revije)."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Option.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/OptionFields.tpl
msgid "Price Options"
msgstr "Možnosti cene"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Option.tpl
msgid ""
"You can set this to a number other than one to allow multiple membership "
"terms."
msgstr "To lahko nastavite na številko, ki ni ena, da se omogoči več pogojev članstva."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Option.tpl
msgid ""
"There are no financial types configured with a linked 'Revenue Account of' "
"account. <a href='%1'>Click here</a> if you want to configure financial "
"types for your site."
msgstr "<a href='%1'>Kliknite tukaj</a>, če želite nastaviti finančne vrste za vašo spletno stran."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/OptionFields.tpl
msgid "Membership Options"
msgstr "Opcije članstva"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/OptionFields.tpl
msgid "Price Field Options"
msgstr "Možnosti cenovnega poljapolja"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/OptionFields.tpl
msgid ""
"Fill in a row for each membership type you want to offer as an option (click"
" 'another choice' for each additional choice). Click the help icon for more "
"info on membership price sets."
msgstr "Izpolnite vrstico za vsako vrsto članstva, ki jo želite ponuditi kot možnost (kliknite »drugo izbiro« za vsako dodatno izbiro). Kliknite ikono pomoči za več informacij o nizu cen članstva."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/OptionFields.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter up to fifteen (15) multiple choice options in this table (click "
"'another choice' for each additional choice). If you need more than ten "
"options, you can create an unlimited number of additional choices using the "
"Edit Price Options link after saving this new field. Enter a description of "
"the option in the 'Label' column, and the associated price in the 'Amount' "
"column. Click the 'Default' radio button to the left of an option if you "
"want that to be selected by default."
msgstr "Vnesite do petnajst (15) možnosti izbire v tej tabeli (kliknite » drugo izbiro « za vsako dodatno izbiro). Če potrebujete več kot deset možnosti, lahko ustvarite neomejeno število dodatnih možnosti z uporabo povezave Uredi možnosti cen po tem, ko shranite to novo polje. Vnesite opis možnosti v stolpcu » Label « in pripadajočo ceno v stolpcu » Priklop «. Kliknite gumb » Privzeti « na levo od možnosti, če želite, da se to izbere privzeto."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/OptionFields.tpl
msgid "Max Participant"
msgstr "Največja udeleženka"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Preview.tpl
msgid "Showing price set as it will be displayed within a form."
msgstr "Prikaz cene, ki bo prikazana v obliki."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Preview.tpl
msgid "Showing field as it will be displayed in a form."
msgstr "Prikaz polja, kot bo prikazano v obliki."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/PriceSet.tpl
msgid "Membership will renew automatically."
msgstr "Članstvo se bo samodejno obnovilo."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Set.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to edit the title and group-level help for a set of Price "
"fields."
msgstr "Uporabite ta obrazec za urejanje naslova in pomoči na ravni skupine za cenikovnih polj."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Set.tpl
msgid "The name of this Price Set"
msgstr "Ime te cene"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Set.tpl
msgid ""
"No Components have been enabled for your site that can be configured with "
"the price sets. Click <a href='%1'>here</a> if you want to enable "
"CiviEvent/CiviContribute for your site."
msgstr "Za vašo spletno stran, ki jo lahko konfigurirate z nastavitvami cen, ni omogočenih nobenih komponent. Kliknite<a href='%1'>Tukaj.</a>Če želite omogočiti CiviEvent/CiviPrispevek za vašo spletno stran."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Set.tpl
msgid "Explanatory text displayed at the beginning of this group of fields."
msgstr "Obrazložitveno besedilo, prikazano na začetku te skupine polj."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Set.tpl
msgid "Explanatory text displayed below this group of fields."
msgstr "Obrazložitveno besedilo je prikazano pod to skupino polj."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Form/Set.tpl
msgid "Fields for this Set"
msgstr "Polja za ta nabor"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"You may enter a negative amount value if the field or option is being used "
"to discount the total price. Use a price of 1 and Display Amount off "
"(unchecked) to allow a user to enter a contribution amount in a Text / "
"Numeric Quantity field."
msgstr "Vnesete lahko negativno vrednost, če se polje ali možnost uporablja za popust na skupno ceno. Uporabite ceno 1 in Prikaži znesek off (nepreverjeno), da lahko uporabnik vnese znesek prispevka v polje Text / Numeric Količina."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Select between Admin/Public for each option. 'Public' will show the option "
"to all users accessing the price set. Use 'Admin' to limit the option to "
"users with the 'CiviEvent: edit event participants’ permission (when viewing"
" the field via the event registration pages) or the ‘CiviContribute: edit "
"contributions’ permission (when accessing the field through a contribution "
"page)."
msgstr "Izberite med Admin/Javni za vsako možnost. \"Javni\" bo prikazal možnost vsem uporabnikom, ki dostopajo do nabora cen. Uporabite \"Admin\", da omejite možnost uporabnikom z dovoljenjem \"CiviEvent: uredite udeležence dogodka\" (pri ogledu polja preko strani za prijavo dogodka) ali dovoljenjem \"CiviPrispevek: uredite prispevke\" (pri dostopu do polja prek strani za prispevek)."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Enter a value here if you want to increment the number of registered "
"participants per unit against the maximum number of participants allowed for"
" this event. For example, if this price field is for a table at a fundraiser"
" which seats eight people, you would set Participant Count to 8."
msgstr "Vnesite vrednost, če želite povečati število prijavljenih udeležencev na enoto z največjim številom udeležencev, ki so dovoljeni za ta dogodek. Če je na primer to cenovno polje za mizo na dobrodelni prireditvi, na kateri je osem oseb, nastavite število udeležencev na 8."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"If you do not want this option to increment the participant count for the "
"event you can still restrict how many times this particular option can be "
"chosen.  Leave this field empty and enter a value in the adjacent Max "
"Participants box.  For example, if you leave this empty and set the adjacent"
" Max Participant = 20, only 20 registrants can choose this option before it "
"becomes unavailable to online registrants."
msgstr "Če ne želite, da ta možnost poveča število udeležencev za dogodek, lahko še vedno omejite, kolikokrat lahko izberete to možnost. Pustite to polje prazno in vnesite vrednost v sosednje polje Max Udeleženke. Na primer, če pustite to prazno in nastavite sosednji Max Udeleženec = 20, lahko to možnost izbere le 20 registracijskih zavezancev, preden postane nedostopna za spletne registracijske zavezance."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want to limit the number of participants who can chose this option, "
"enter that number here. This limit is separate from the maximum number of "
"participants allowed to register for the event (you can set that number from"
" Configure Event > Info and Settings). "
msgstr "Če želite omejiti število udeležencev, ki lahko izberejo to možnost, vnesite to številko tukaj. Ta omejitev je ločena od največjega števila udeležencev, ki se lahko prijavijo za dogodek (nastavite lahko to številko iz Nastavitve dogodka > Informacije in Nastavitve). "

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Fields with 'Public' visibility will be displayed on your Event Information "
"page AND will be available in the online registration (self-service) form. "
"For some events you may want to allow staff to select special options with "
"special pricing and / or discounts (using negative price set field values). "
"Select 'Admin' visibility for these Price Fields. They will only be included"
" when staff or volunteers are registering participants from the back-office "
"'Register Event Participants' screen. If the parent price field visibility "
"is ‘Public’ then it should be possible to set individual price options as "
"'Admin', but it should have at least one 'Public' option. If the parent "
"price field visibility is 'Admin', then all the price field options should "
"be set to 'Admin', including any new options added to the form."
msgstr "Polja s »Javno« prepoznavnostjo bodo prikazana na vaši strani z informacijami o dogodku IN bodo na voljo v spletni prijavni (samopostrežni) obliki. Za nekatere dogodke boste morda želeli osebju omogočiti, da izbere posebne možnosti s posebnimi cenami in / ali popusti (z uporabo negativnih cenovnih vrednosti polja). Izberite »Admin« prepoznavnost za ta cenovna polja. Vključeni bodo le takrat, ko bodo zaposleni ali prostovoljci prijavili udeležence iz zaledne pisarne »Register Event Udeleženke« zaslona. Če je vidnost matičnega cenovnega polja „Javna“, potem bi moralo biti mogoče določiti individualne cenovne možnosti kot »Admin«, vendar bi moralo imeti vsaj eno »javno« možnost. Če je vidnost matičnega cenovnega polja »Admin«, bi morale biti vse možnosti cenovnega polja nastavljene v »Admin«, vključno z vsemi novimi možnostmi, dodanimi v obliki."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Create an option row for each membership type you want to offer as a choice."
" The option Label and Amount columns will be automatically filled with the "
"selected membership type name and associated fee. However you can over-ride "
"these values as needed. For example, you can create an option for a special "
"discount on a particular membership."
msgstr "Ustvarite opcijsko vrstico za vsako vrsto članstva, ki jo želite ponuditi kot izbiro. Možnost Stolpci z oznako in zneskom bodo samodejno zapolnjeni z izbranim imenom vrste članstva in pripadajočo pristojbino. Vendar lahko po potrebi prekoračite te vrednosti. Na primer, lahko ustvarite možnost za poseben popust na določeno članstvo."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Leave the Membership Type blank for additional non-membership options (e.g. "
"magazine subscription)."
msgstr "Članstvo Vrsta pusti prazno za dodatne možnosti nečlanov (npr. naročnina na revijo)."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Generally you will create a separate price field for each non-overlapping "
"\"class\" of membership (e.g. National membership vs. Local Chapter "
"membership)."
msgstr "Na splošno boste ustvarili ločeno cenovno polje za vsak nepremagan \"razred\" članstva (npr. nacionalno članstvo v primerjavi z lokalnim poglavjem članstvo)."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"EXAMPLE: A price set with 3 price fields. National membership (with 3 price "
"options - radio button style), Regional membership (checkbox), and an "
"optional magazine subscription."
msgstr "PRIMER: Cena nastavljena s 3 cenovna polja. Nacionalno članstvo (s 3 možnostmi - radijski gumb stil), Regionalno članstvo (checkbox) in neobvezno naročnino na revijo."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid "National Membership"
msgstr "Nacionalna članica"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid "Student"
msgstr "Študent"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid "Senior"
msgstr "Senior"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid "Join your local chapter"
msgstr "Pridružite se lokalnemu poglavju"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid "Subscribe to Green Times"
msgstr "Naročite se na zelene čase"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Auto-renew Memberships - You can offer constituents the option to have their"
" membership renewed automatically AND use the membership price set feature "
"if:"
msgstr "Samodejno obnavljanje članstva - Komponentom lahko ponudite možnost, da se njihovo članstvo samodejno obnovi, in uporabite bonusno funkcijo za ceno članstva, če:"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid "You are using a payment processor that supports auto-renewals."
msgstr "Uporabljate ponudnik plačilnih storitev, ki podpira samodejno obnavljanje."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"All membership types in the price set have the auto-renew feature enabled "
"(Administer > CiviMember > Membership Types)"
msgstr "Vse vrste članstva v nizu cen imajo omogočeno samodejno obnovo funkcije (Administer > CiviMember > Članstva)"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"All membership types in the price set have the same duration (e.g. they are "
"one year memberships)."
msgstr "Vse vrste članstva v nizu cen imajo enako trajanje (npr. enoletno članstvo)."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"These constraints are due to the fact that when a constituent signs up for "
"multiple memberships using a price set - a single recurring payment record "
"is created which covers the total fees for all selected memberships."
msgstr "Te omejitve so posledica dejstva, da ko se komponenta prijavi za več članstev z uporabo niza cen - nastane en ponavljajoč se plačilni zapis, ki zajema skupne pristojbine za vse izbrane člane."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"If you select a membership type, a membership will be created or renewed "
"when users select this option. Leave this column blank for non-membership "
"options (e.g. magazine subscription)."
msgstr "Če izberete vrsto članstva, bo članstvo ustvarjeno ali obnovljeno, ko bodo uporabniki izbrali to možnost. Pustite ta stolpec prazen za možnosti nečlanov (npr. naročnina na revijo)."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.hlp
msgid "Description is not shown publicly."
msgstr "Opis ni javno prikazan."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"Unable to delete the '%1' Price Field - it is currently in use by one or "
"more active events or contribution pages or contributions  or event "
"templates."
msgstr "Ni moč zbrisati cenovnega polja '%1' - trenutno je v uporabi enega ali več aktivnih dogodkov ali strani za prispevke ali prispevkov ali predlog za dogodke."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Field.tpl templates/CRM/Price/Page/Option.tpl
msgid "Tax Label"
msgstr "Davčna oznaka"

