msgstr "Skupaj %1"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/LineItem.tpl
msgid "Amount Paid"
msgstr "Plačani znesek"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/LineItem.tpl
msgid "Amount Due"
msgstr "Zapadli znesek"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Option.tpl
msgid ""
"Unable to delete the '%1' Price Field Option - it is currently in use by one"
" or more active events  or contribution pages or contributions."
msgstr "Ni moč izbrisati opcije \"%1\" – trenutno je v uporabi enega ali več aktivnih dogodkov ali strani ali prispevkov."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Option.tpl
msgid "Post Help"
msgstr "Pošta"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Option.tpl
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "Največ"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Option.tpl
msgid "New Option for '%1'"
msgstr "Nova možnost za '%1'"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Set.tpl
msgid ""
"Price sets allow you to set up flexible multi-option pricing schemes for "
"your contribution, event and membership pages. Use a price set if the "
"standard pricing options are insufficient for your needs."
msgstr "Cenovni nizi vam omogočajo, da vzpostavite prilagodljive večmožnostne cenovne sheme za vaše prispevke, prireditve in strani za članstvo. Uporabite ceno, če standardne cenovne možnosti ne zadostujejo za vaše potrebe."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Set.tpl
msgid ""
"Unable to delete the '%1' price set - it is currently in use by one or more "
"active events or contribution pages or contributions or event templates."
msgstr "Ni moč zbrisati nabora cen '%1' - trenutno je v uporabi enega ali več aktivnih dogodkov ali strani za prispevke ali prispevkov ali predlog za dogodke."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Set.tpl
msgid "Set Title"
msgstr "Naslov nabora"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Set.tpl
msgid "Add Set of Price Fields"
msgstr "Dodaj cenovna polja"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Set.tpl
msgid "No price sets have been added yet."
msgstr "Cene še niso bile dodane."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/Set.tpl
msgid "You can <a href='%1'>create one here</a>."
msgstr "Lahko <a href='%1'>create eno tukaj</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid ""
"If you no longer want to use this price set, click the event title below, "
"and modify the fees for that event."
msgstr "Če te cene ne želite več uporabljati, kliknite na spodnji naslov dogodka in spremenite pristojbine za ta dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid ""
"This price set is used by the event(s) listed below. Click the event title "
"to change or remove the price set."
msgstr "Ta niz cen uporabljajo spodaj navedeni dogodki. Kliknite na naslov dogodka, da spremenite ali odstranite niz cene."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid "Date(s)"
msgstr "Datumi"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid "Change or remove the price set used for this event."
msgstr "Spremenite ali odstranite cenik, ki se uporablja za ta dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid ""
"If you no longer want to use this price set, click the contribution page "
"title below, and modify the Amounts or Membership tab configuration."
msgstr "Če te cene ne želite več uporabljati, kliknite na naslov strani za prispevek spodaj in spremenite nastavitve zavihkov Zneski ali članstvo."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid ""
"This price set is used by the contribution page(s) listed below. Click the "
"contribution page title to change or remove the price set."
msgstr "Ta niz cen uporablja stran(-e) za prispevke, ki so navedeni spodaj. Kliknite naslov strani za prispevke, da spremenite ali odstranite niz cen."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid "Change or remove the price set used for this contribution page."
msgstr "Spremenite ali odstranite ceno, ki se uporablja za to stran prispevka."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid ""
"If you no longer want to use this price set, click the event template title "
"below, and modify the fees for that event."
msgstr "Če te cene ne želite več uporabljati, kliknite na spodnji naslov predloge za dogodek in spremenite provizije za ta dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid ""
"This price set is used by the event template(s) listed below. Click the "
"event template title to change or remove the price set."
msgstr "Ta nastavitev cene se uporablja za predloge za dogodke, navedene spodaj. Kliknite naslov predloge za spremembo ali odstranitev niza cen."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid "Event Template Name"
msgstr "Ime predloge dogodka"

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid "Change or remove the price set used for this event template."
msgstr "Spremenite ali odstranite cenik, ki se uporablja za to predlogo dogodka."

#: templates/CRM/Price/Page/table.tpl
msgid ""
"This price set is used by at least one contribution, but is not used by any "
"active events or contribution pages or event templates."
msgstr "Ta niz cen se uporablja za vsaj en prispevek, vendar ga ne uporabljajo nobeni aktivni dogodki ali strani s prispevki ali predloge za dogodke."

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Form/Dynamic.tpl
msgid "Edit Details"
msgstr "Uredi podrobnosti"

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Form/Search.tpl
msgid ""
"No fields in this Profile have been configured as searchable. Ask the site "
"administrator to check the Profile setup."
msgstr "Nobeno polje v tem profilu ni bilo nastavljeno kot iskanje. Vprašajte upravitelja strani, da preveri nastavitev profila."

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Page/Listings.tpl
msgid "Displaying contacts where:"
msgstr "Prikazujem stike kjer:"

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Page/Listings.tpl
msgid "Map these contacts"
msgstr "Kartiraj te stike"

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Page/Listings.tpl
msgid ""
"No fields in this Profile have been configured to display as a result column"
" in the search results table. Ask the site administrator to check the "
"Profile setup."
msgstr "Nobeno polje v tem profilu ni bilo nastavljeno za prikaz kot rezultat v tabeli rezultatov iskanja. Upravitelja strani prosite, naj preveri nastavitev profila."

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Page/MultipleRecordFieldsListing.tpl
msgid "No records of type '%1' found."
msgstr "Ni najdenih zapisov tipa '%1'."

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Page/MultipleRecordFieldsListing.tpl
msgid "Add %1 Record"
msgstr "Dodaj zapis %1"

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Page/MultipleRecordFieldsListing.tpl
msgid "Add New Record"
msgstr "Dodaj nov zapis"

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Page/View.tpl
msgid "Back to Listings"
msgstr "Nazaj na sezname"

#: templates/CRM/Profile/Page/View.tpl
msgid "Map Primary Address"
msgstr "Kartiraj primarni naslov"

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Assign a unique name to each of your mass messages. Select a naming "
"convention that will help keep your messages organized."
msgstr "Vsakemu vašemu množičnemu sporočilu dodelite edinstveno ime. Izberite dogovor o poimenovanju, ki vam bo pomagal organizirati sporočila."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Determine the contacts in your database who should receive this Mass SMS by "
"first selecting one or more <strong>Included Groups</strong>. (Groups must "
"be assigned the <strong>Mailing List</strong> type to be available on this "
"screen - you can update this for an existing group from <strong>Manage "
"Groups &raquo; Settings</strong>.)"
msgstr "Določite stike v vaši bazi podatkov, ki naj bi prejeli ta masni SMS, tako da najprej izberete eno ali več <strong>Vključenih skupin</strong>. (Skupini mora biti dodeljen <strong>Mailing List</strong>, ki bo na voljo na tem zaslonu - to lahko posodobite za obstoječo skupino iz <strong>Manage Groups &raquo; Nastavitve</strong>.)"

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"You also have the option to <strong>Exclude</strong> some contacts from your"
" included groups by selecting one or more <strong>Excluded Groups</strong>. "
"Contacts who are in both groups will NOT receive the SMS (they are "
"'excluded')."
msgstr "Imate tudi možnost za <strong>Exclude</strong> nekateri stiki iz vključenih skupin z izbiro enega ali več <strong>Izključene skupine</strong>. Kontakti, ki so v obeh skupinah ne bodo prejeli SMS (so 'izključeni')."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If you have sent other Mass SMS - you can additionally Include (or Exclude) "
"contacts who received those Mass SMS. CiviCRM will eliminate any "
"duplications so that contacts who are in an Included Group AND were "
"recipients of an Included Mailing will only be sent one copy of this SMS."
msgstr "Če ste poslali druge Mass SMS - lahko dodatno Vključite (ali Izključite) stike, ki so prejeli tiste Mass SMS. CiviCRM bo odpravil vsa podvajanja, tako da bodo stiki, ki so v vključeni skupini IN so bili prejemniki vključene pošte, poslali samo eno kopijo tega SMS."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"After you click <strong>Next</strong> - the total number of selected "
"recipients will be displayed on the next screen. Use this as a 'reality-"
"check' to help you confirm that you've targeted (and excluded) the desired "
"recipients."
msgstr "Ko kliknete <strong>Next</strong> - bo na naslednjem zaslonu prikazano skupno število izbranih prejemnikov. Uporabite to kot 'preverjanje resničnosti', da boste lahko potrdili, da ste ciljali (in izključili) želene prejemnike."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"You also have the option to <strong>Exclude</strong> some contacts in your "
"included groups by selecting one or more <strong>Excluded Groups</strong>. "
"Contacts who are in both groups will NOT receive the SMS (they are "
"'excluded')."
msgstr "Imate tudi možnost za <strong>Exclude</strong> nekateri stiki v vključenih skupinah z izbiro enega ali več <strong>Izključene skupine</strong>. Kontakti, ki so v obeh skupinah ne bodo prejeli SMS (so 'izključeni')."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If you have sent other Mass SMS - you can additionally Include (or Exclude) "
"contacts who received those SMS. CiviCRM will eliminate any duplications so "
"that contacts who are in an Included Group AND were recipients of an "
"Included Mailing will only be sent one copy of this Mass SMS."
msgstr "Če ste poslali drugo Mass SMS - lahko dodatno Vključite (ali Izključite) stike, ki so prejeli te SMS. CiviCRM bo odpravil vsa podvajanja, tako da stiki, ki so v vključeni skupini IN so bili prejemniki vključene pošte bo poslana samo ena kopija tega Mass SMS."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid "Select the SMS provider for this mass message from the dropdown list."
msgstr "Izberite ponudnika SMS za to sporočilo o masi s spustnega seznama."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Go to <a href='%1'>Administer CiviCRM &raquo; System Settings &raquo; SMS "
"Providers</a> to add or edit SMS Provider."
msgstr "Pojdi na <a href='%1'>administer CiviCRM &raquo; Sistemske nastavitve &raquo; SMS Ponudniki </a> za dodajanje ali urejanje SMS Ponudnik."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Contact your site administrator if you need to use a SMS Provider which is "
"not in the dropdown list."
msgstr "Če potrebujete ponudnika SMS, ki ni na spustnem seznamu, se obrnite na svojega skrbnika."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.tpl
msgid ""
"To send a Mass SMS, you must have a valid group of recipients - either at "
"least one group that's a Mailing List"
msgstr "Če želite poslati Mass SMS, morate imeti veljavno skupino prejemnikov - bodisi vsaj eno skupino, ki je dopisni seznam"

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Group.tpl
msgid "Mailing Recipients"
msgstr "Pošiljanje prejemnikov"

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Provider.tpl
msgid "Are you sure you would like to execute this job?"
msgstr "Si prepričan, da bi rad opravil to delo?"

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Schedule.hlp
msgid ""
"You can schedule Mass SMS to be sent starting at a specific date and time, "
"OR you can request that they be sent as soon as possible by checking "
"&quot;Send Immediately&quot;."
msgstr "Lahko urnik Mass SMS, ki se pošlje na določen datum in čas, ALI lahko zahtevate, da se pošljejo v najkrajšem možnem času s preverjanjem &quot;Send takoj&quot;."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Schedule.hlp
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Submit Mass SMS/strong> to add this to the Mass SMS mailing "
"queue. An automated task which runs periodically on your server processes "
"mailings in the queue, and starts actually sending out your Mass SMS."
msgstr "Kliknite <strong>Submit Mass SMS/močan>, da dodate to v Mass SMS-poštno vrsto. Avtomatsko opravilo, ki redno teče na strežnikih procesih pošiljanja sporočil v vrsti, in začne dejansko pošiljati vaš Mass SMS."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Schedule.hlp
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Continue Later</strong> if you're not ready to schedule or "
"send this Mass SMS."
msgstr "Kliknite <strong>Continue Later</strong>, če niste pripravljeni za urnik ali pošljite to Mass SMS."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Schedule.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Trouble-shooting Tip</strong> - If you find that your SMS are not "
"being sent, ask the system administrator or technical support contact for "
"your site to verify that the automated task (&quot;cron job&quot;) is "
"running - and how frequently."
msgstr "<strong>Trouble-shooping Tip</strong> - Če ugotovite, da se vaš SMS ne pošilja, vprašajte sistemskega administratorja ali tehnično podporo stik za vašo spletno stran, da preverite, da avtomatsko opravilo (&quot;cron how&quot;) teče - in kako pogosto."

#: templates/CRM/SMS/Form/Schedule.tpl
msgid ""
"You can schedule this Mass SMS to be sent starting at a specific date and "
"time, OR you can request that it be sent as soon as possible by checking "
