#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid "Choose the field to add to the profile."
msgstr "Izberite polje za dodajanje profilu."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid "Restrictions:"
msgstr "Omejitve:"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Only one field of each communication type (EG. phone) can use the primary "
"location type."
msgstr "Samo eno polje vsakega komunikacijskega tipa (EG. telefon) lahko uporablja primarno lokacijsko vrsto."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"When you choose the primary location type the collected data will use the "
"default location type from the <a href=\"%1\">Location types</a> setup."
msgstr "Ko izberete osnovno lokacijsko vrsto, bodo zbrani podatki uporabili privzeto lokacijsko vrsto iz <a href=\"%1\">Location types</a> nastavitev."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"The field label displayed on the form (over-ride the default field label "
"here, if desired)."
msgstr "Oznaka polja, prikazana na obrazcu (po potrebi preglejte privzeto oznako polja)."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Fields which are part of a custom data set that supports multiple records "
"will be listed below the standard single-record fields when in profile edit "
"view. Use this option to determine which fields you want displayed in that "
"listing"
msgstr "Polja, ki so del podatkovnega niza po meri, ki podpira več zapisov, bodo pri urejanju profilov navedena pod standardnimi enozapisnimi polji. Uporabite to možnost, da določite, katera polja želite prikazati v seznamu"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid "Are users required to complete this field?"
msgstr "Ali morajo uporabniki izpolniti to polje?"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid "If checked, users can view but not edit this field."
msgstr "Če je možnost omogočena, si lahko uporabniki ogledajo to polje, vendar ga ne uredijo."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid "NOTE: View Only fields can not be included in Profile Search forms."
msgstr "OPOMBA: Ogled Samo polja niso vključena v obrazce za iskanje profilov."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Is this field hidden from public search ('User and User Admin Only'), or is "
"it visible to the public and potentially searchable in the Profile Search "
"form ('Public Pages' or 'Public Pages and Listings')?  ('User and User Admin"
" Only') fields can still be used for Edit and Create mode."
msgstr "Ali je to polje skrito pred javnim iskanjem (»User and User Admin only «) ali pa je vidno javnosti in ga je možno iskati v obrazcu za iskanje profila (» Public Pages « ali » Public Pages and Listings «)? (»User and Users Admin only «) polja se še vedno lahko uporabljajo za način Uredi in ustvari."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"When visibility is 'Public Pages and Listings', users can also click the "
"field value when viewing a contact in order to locate other contacts with "
"the same value(s) (i.e. other contacts who live in Poland)."
msgstr "Ko je vidnost 'Javni strani in oglasi', lahko uporabniki ob ogledu stika kliknejo tudi na vrednost polja, da bi našli druge stike z enako vrednostjo(e) (tj. druge stike, ki živijo na Poljskem)."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid "Do you want to include this field in the Profile's Search form?"
msgstr "Ali želite to polje vključiti v obrazec za iskanje Profile?"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Is this field included as a column in the search results table? This setting"
" applies only to fields with 'Public Pages' or 'Public Pages and Listings' "
"visibility."
msgstr "Ali je to polje vključeno kot stolpec v tabeli rezultatov iskanja? Ta nastavitev velja samo za polja z vidljivostjo 'Javnih strani' ali 'Javnih strani in oglasov'."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Explanatory text displayed to users for this field (can include HTML "
"formatting tags)."
msgstr "Pojasnjevalno besedilo, ki se prikaže uporabnikom za to polje (lahko vključuje oznake formatiranja HTML)."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Weight controls the order in which fields are displayed within a profile. "
"Enter a positive or negative integer - lower numbers are displayed ahead of "
"higher numbers. Note: The field order will not respect non-multi fields "
"interspersed with multi record fields in edit mode."
msgstr "Teža nadzoruje vrstni red prikazov polj znotraj profila. Vnesite pozitivno ali negativno celo število - nižje številke so prikazane pred višjimi številkami. Vedite: Vrstni red polj ne bo upošteval več polj, ki se prepletajo z več zapisnimi polji v urejevalnem načinu."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Disable this option to remove the field from the profile without deleting "
"it."
msgstr "Onemogoči to možnost za odstranitev polja iz profila brez brisanja."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"WARNING: Deleting this profile field will remove it from Profile forms and "
"listings. If this field is used in any 'stand-alone' Profile forms, you will"
" need to update those forms to remove this field."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Brisanje tega profilnega polja ga bo odstranilo iz profilnih obrazcev in seznamov. Če se to polje uporablja v poljubnih profilnih obrazcih, boste morali te obrazce posodobiti, da odstranite to polje."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"Select the type of CiviCRM record and the field you want to include in this "
"Profile."
msgstr "Izberite vrsto zapisa CiviCRM in polje, ki ga želite vključiti v ta profil."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"You can not mark fields as Searchable in a profile that contains fields for "
"multiple record types."
msgstr "Polja ne morete označiti kot Iskanja v profilu, ki vsebuje polja za več vrst zapisov."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.tpl
msgid " fields can not be marked as Searchable in a profile."
msgstr " polj ni mogoče označiti kot Iskanje v profilu."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"You can not mark a field as a Result Column in a profile that contains "
"fields from multiple record types."
msgstr "Polja ne morete označiti kot stolpec Result v profilu, ki vsebuje polja iz več vrst zapisov."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.tpl
msgid " can not be used as a Result Column for profile searches."
msgstr " ni mogoče uporabiti kot stolpec rezultatov za iskanje profilov."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
"Oops. One or more fields in this profile are configured to be Searchable and"
" / or shown in a Results Column, AND you are trying to add a "
msgstr "Ups. Eno ali več polj v tem profilu so nastavljena tako, da je mogoče iskati in / ali prikazana v stolpcu rezultatov, IN poskušate dodati "

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Field.tpl
msgid ""
" field. Profiles with a mixture of field types can not include Searchable or"
" Results Column fields. If you save this field now, the Seachable and "
"Results Column settings will be removed for all fields in this profile. Do "
"you want to continue?"
msgstr " polje. Profili z mešanico vrst polj ne smejo vključevati polj v stolpcih Iskanje ali Rezultati. Če to polje shranite zdaj, bodo nastavitve v stolpcih Seachable in Rezultati odstranjene za vsa polja v tem profilu. Ali želite nadaljevati?"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid "Explanatory text for profile."
msgstr "Obrazložitveno besedilo za profil."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Profiles can be used in many different ways (and a single profile can be "
"used in multiple contexts)"
msgstr "Profili se lahko uporabljajo na različne načine (in en sam profil se lahko uporablja v več kontekstih)"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"You can collect additional information about a donor or event participant by"
" including profiles directly in Online Contribution Pages and Event "
"Registration forms. When using a profile in this manner you do not need to "
"check any of the \"Exposed To\" checkboxes."
msgstr "Dodatne informacije o darovalcu ali udeležencu dogodka lahko zberete tako, da profile vključite neposredno v spletne strani za prispevke in prijavne obrazce za dogodke. Pri uporabi profila na ta način vam ni treba preveriti nobenih potrditvenih polj » Izpostavljeno «."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check <strong>Standalone Form</strong> if you want it to use this profile "
"for custom forms. If the Legacy Profiles extension is enabled, it can also "
"be used for listings."
msgstr "Preverite <strong>Standalone Form</strong>, če želite, da se ta profil uporablja za obrazce po meri. Če je razširitev profilov Legacy omogočena, se lahko uporablja tudi za oglase."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"These features are being phased out in favor of FormBuilder and SearchKit."
msgstr "Te funkcije se postopno odpravljajo v korist podjetja FormBuilder in SearchKit."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check <strong>Advanced Search Display Columns</strong> to use this profile "
"to display an alternate set of results columns for the Basic or Advanced "
"Search."
msgstr "Preverite <strong>advanced Iskanje Prikaz Stolpci</strong> za uporabo tega profila za prikaz alternativnega nabora rezultatov stolpcev za osnovno ali napredno iskanje."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"The default profile can be selected under Administer > Customize Data and "
"Screens > Search Preferences. The Advanced Search also allows users to "
"select a different profile under the Search Settings on that form."
msgstr "Privzeti profil lahko izberete pod Administer > Prilagodite podatke in zaslone > Možnosti iskanja. Napredno iskanje omogoča uporabnikom tudi izbiro drugega profila pod Nastavitve iskanja na tem obrazcu."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check <strong>User Registration</strong> if you want this Profile to be "
"included in the New Account registration form."
msgstr "Preverite <strong>User Registracija</strong>, če želite, da je ta profil vključen v novi obrazec za registracijo računa."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check <strong>View/Edit User Account</strong> to include it in the view and "
"edit screens for existing user accounts."
msgstr "Preverite <strong>View/Uredi uporabniški račun</strong>, da ga vključite v prikaz in uredite zaslone za obstoječe uporabniške račune."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Other forms or extensions that use this profile. When possible, it also "
"lists the ID of that form."
msgstr "Drugi obrazci ali razširitve, ki uporabljajo ta profil. Kadar je mogoče, navaja tudi ID tega obrazca."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Enable/Disable this checkbox to add/remove cancel button on the profile "
"form."
msgstr "Omogoči/Onemogoči to potrditveno polje za dodajanje/odstranitev gumba preklica na profilnem obrazcu."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Override the default button text for the cancel button for this profile"
msgstr "Povozi privzeto besedilo gumba za gumb preklica za ta profil"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Override the default button text for the submit button for this profile"
msgstr "Povozi privzeto besedilo gumba za gumb za predložitev za ta profil"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"When reCAPTCHA is enabled for a profile form, anonymous users are required "
"to read an image with letters and numbers and enter the value in a field. "
"This helps prevent abuse by automated scripts."
msgstr "Ko je reCAPTCHA omogočena za profilni obrazec, morajo anonimni uporabniki prebrati sliko s črkami in številkami ter vnesti vrednost v polje. To pomaga preprečevati zlorabo z avtomatiziranimi skriptami."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"To use reCAPTCHA you must sign up at <a %1>Google's reCaptcha site</a> to "
"get your public and private keys. Then enter both keys in <a %2>Administer "
"CiviCRM &raquo; System Settings &raquo; reCAPTCHA settings</a>."
msgstr "Za uporabo reCAPTCHA se morate prijaviti na <a %1>Google's reCaptcha site</a>, da bi dobili svoje javne in zasebne ključe. Nato vnesite oba ključa v <a %2>zadminister CiviCRM &raquo; Sistemske nastavitve &raquo; reCAPTCHA nastavitve</a>."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Do not enable this feature if you are using this profile as an HTML Form "
"Snippet embedded in a non-CiviCRM web page. reCAPTCHA requires dynamic page "
"generation. Submitting a stand-alone form with reCAPTCHA included will "
"always result in a reCAPTCHA validation error."
msgstr "Ne omogočajte te možnosti, če uporabljate ta profil kot HTML obrazec Snippet, vgrajen na spletni strani, ki ni CiviCRM. reCAPTCHA zahteva dinamično ustvarjanje strani. Pošiljanje samostojne oblike z vključenim reCAPTCHA bo vedno povzročilo napako pri validaciji reCAPTCHA."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"reCAPTCHA is also not available when a profile is used inside the User "
"Registration and My Account screens."
msgstr "reCAPTCHA tudi ni na voljo, ko se profil uporablja znotraj uporabniške registracije in zaslonov Moj račun."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If you are using this profile as a contact signup form, using it in an "
"online contribution page OR an event registration page, anonymous users will"
" be given the option to create a %1 User Account as part of completing the "
"form."
msgstr "Če ta profil uporabljate kot obrazec za prijavo na stik, ga uporabljate na spletni strani za prijavo prispevka ALI na registracijski strani dogodka, bodo anonimni uporabniki dobili možnost, da v okviru izpolnitve obrazca ustvarijo uporabniški račun %1."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"This feature requires your Drupal User Settings to allow 'visitors to create"
" accounts' (with or without administrator approval). The 'Email "
"Verification' option may be enabled or disabled."
msgstr "Ta funkcija zahteva vaše nastavitve uporabnikov Drupal, da lahko \"opazovalci ustvarijo račune\" (z odobritvijo administratorja ali brez nje). Možnost \"Email Verification\" je lahko omogočena ali onemogočena."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If the 'Email Verification' option is enabled, users will receive a welcome "
"email from Drupal with login information. Otherwise they will select a "
"Password inline, and if administrator approval is not required they will be "
"automatically logged in as soon as the transaction is completed."
msgstr "Če je možnost \"Email Verification\" omogočena, bodo uporabniki prejeli pozdravno e-pošto od Drupala z prijavnimi podatki. V nasprotnem primeru bodo izbrali geslo inline, in če odobritev administratorja ni potrebna, bodo samodejno prijavljeni takoj, ko bo transakcija zaključena."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"This feature requires the 'Allow User Registration' setting to be 'Yes' in "
"Joomla Global Configuration >> System Settings."
msgstr "Ta funkcija zahteva nastavitev 'Dovoli registracijo uporabnika' za 'Da' v globalni konfiguraciji Joomla >> Sistemske nastavitve."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"In addition, you must include a Primary Email Address field in the profile."
msgstr "Poleg tega morate v profil vključiti polje Primarni e-poštni naslov."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If you are using the profile as a contact signup and editing form, this "
"option controls what happens if the data matches an existing contact record."
msgstr "Če profil uporabljate kot obrazec za prijavo in urejanje stikov, ta možnost nadzoruje, kaj se zgodi, če se podatki ujemajo z obstoječim kontaktnim zapisom."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>No duplicate checking:</strong> saves the data as a new contact, "
"without comparing them to existing contact records for possible duplicates."
msgstr "<strong>No dvojno preverjanje:</strong> shrani podatke kot nov stik, ne da bi jih primerjali z obstoječimi kontaktnimi zapisi za morebitne dvojnike."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Update the matching contact:</strong> if a matching contact exists "
"(using the default unsupervised rule), update the contact record."
msgstr "<strong>Posodi ujemanje kontakt:</strong>, če obstaja ujemanje stika (z uporabo privzetega pravila nenadzorovano), posodobite zapis kontakta."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Depending on which fields are in the profile, it can be somewhat safe to "
"use, but it might also result in contact data being over-written by "
"malicious visitors."
msgstr "Glede na to, katera polja so v profilu, je lahko nekoliko varna za uporabo, lahko pa ima tudi za posledico, da so kontaktni podatki preveč napisani s strani zlonamernih obiskovalcev."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If there are multiple matching contacts, the first matching record is used."
msgstr "Če obstaja več ujemajočih stikov, se uporabi prvi ujemajoči zapis."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Issue warning and do not save:</strong> if a matching contact "
"exists, display a warning and do not save anything."
msgstr "<strong>Isue opozorilo in ne shranite:</strong>, če obstaja ujemanje stikov, prikaži opozorilo in ne shranite ničesar."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"This setting is ignored if the profile is part of an online contribution "
"form, membership signup or event registration form. In this case a contact "
"match always results in the transaction being linked to the matching contact"
" using the default unsupervised rule.</p>"
msgstr "Ta nastavitev je prezrta, če je profil del spletne prijavnice za prispevke, prijavnice za članstvo ali prijavnice za dogodke. V tem primeru kontaktna tekma vedno povzroči, da je transakcija povezana z ujemajočim se stikom z uporabo privzetega nenadzorovanega pravila.</p>"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to include a link in the listings to view "
"contacts' %1 user account information (e.g. their 'My Account' page). This "
"link will only be included for contacts who have a user account on your "
"website."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, če želite v sezname vključiti povezavo za ogled stikov \"%1 informacije o uporabniškem računu (npr. stran 'Moj račun'). Ta povezava bo vključena samo za stike, ki imajo uporabniški račun na vaši spletni strani."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If you are using this profile as a search form, you can choose to include "
"proximity searching. When enabled, a proximity search block will be added to"
" the search criteria. This block will contain fields to set the proximity "
"start address, and a field to set a 'Radius' (distance from that address)."
msgstr "Če uporabljate ta profil kot iskalno obliko, lahko izberete, da vključite iskanje po bližini. Ko je to omogočeno, bo iskalni blok dodan kriterijem iskanja. Ta blok bo vseboval polja za nastavitev začetnega naslova bližine in polje za nastavitev »Radius « (razdalja od tega naslova)."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Set Proximity Search as required if you want all searches using this profile"
" to require the user to enter a start address and a radius."
msgstr "Nastavi iskanje bližine, kot je potrebno, če želite, da vsa iskanja z uporabo tega profila zahtevajo, da uporabnik vnese začetni naslov in polmer."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Form/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: You must enable a Mapping Provider in order to use the Proximity "
"Search feature (Administer > System Settings > Mapping and Geocoding)."
msgstr "POMEMBNO: Za uporabo funkcije iskanja bližine morate omogočiti ponudnika kartiranja (Administer > System Settings > Mapping and Geocoding)."

