msgstr "Stolpec rezultatov"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Profiles may be linked to specific modules, accessed via built-in CiviCRM "
"URLs, or embedded into any web page using the HTML Form Snippet feature. "
"Examples include:"
msgstr "Profili so lahko povezani z določenimi moduli, do katerih lahko dostopate preko vgrajenih URL- jev CiviCRM ali pa so vgrajeni v katero koli spletno stran z uporabo funkcije Snippet HTML Form. Primeri vključujejo:"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>User Screens</strong> - One or several profiles can be linked to "
"either the <strong>new user registration</strong> and/or view and edit "
"screens for <strong>existing user accounts</strong>."
msgstr "<strong>Uporabniški zasloni</strong>- Eden ali več profilov je mogoče povezati z<strong>nova registracija uporabnika</strong>in/ali ogled in urejanje zaslonov za<strong>obstoječi uporabniški računi</strong>."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>CiviContribute</strong> - When you want to collect information from "
"Contributors via online contribution pages, you can create a profile and "
"link it to to your contribution page as a 'custom page element' (<a "
"href='%1'>Configure Online Contribution Pages</a>)."
msgstr "<strong>CiviPrispevek</strong> - Ko želite zbirati informacije od sodelujočih prek spletnih strani za prispevke, lahko ustvarite profil in ga povežete z vašo stranjo za prispevek kot element strani (<a href='%1'>Configure Online Contribution Pages</a>)."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid "site root"
msgstr "korenina mesta"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Contact Search and Listings</strong> - When you want to provide a "
"search form and search result listings for some or all of your contacts you "
"can create a profile with the desired search fields and link users to the "
"path for that search form. When creating a link to search and listings "
"profiles, add the corresponding profile ID to the end of your query string "
"using the 'gid' parameter. For example, the link to display a search and "
"listings page for a Profile with ID = 3 would be:"
msgstr "<strong>Kontakt Išči in oglasi</strong> - Ko želite zagotoviti iskalno obliko in sezname rezultatov iskanja za nekatere ali vse vaše stike, lahko ustvarite profil z želenimi iskalnimi polji in povežete uporabnike na pot za to iskalno obliko. Ko ustvarite povezavo za iskanje in naštevanje profilov, dodajte ustrezni ID profila na konec vašega iskalnega niza z uporabo parametra 'gid'. Na primer, povezava za prikaz strani iskanja in oglasov za profil z ID = 3 bi bila:"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Contact Signup Forms</strong> - Create link(s) to 'new contact' "
"input form(s) for your Profiles using the following path: <em>%1/%2</em>. "
"(This example links to an input form for Profile ID 3.)"
msgstr "<strong>Kontaktni prijavni obrazci</strong>- Ustvarite povezave do 'novega kontaktnega' vhodnega(-ih) obrazca(-ov) za vaše profile z uporabo naslednje poti:<em>%1/%2</em>. (Ta primer povezuje z vhodnim obrazcem za profil ID 3.)"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Contact Edit Forms</strong> - Allow <strong>authenticated "
"users</strong> to edit their own contact info with a Profile using the "
"following path: <em>%1/%2</em>. (This example links to an edit form for "
"Profile ID 3.)"
msgstr "<strong>Stik Uredi obrazce</strong>- Dovoli<strong>preverjeni uporabniki</strong>urejanje lastnih kontaktnih podatkov s profilom z uporabo naslednje poti:<em>%1/%2</em>. (Ta primer se nanaša na urejevalni obrazec za profil ID 3.)"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>HTML Form Snippet</strong> - If you want more control over form "
"layout, or want to add Profile input forms to non-CiviCRM blocks, pages "
"and/or sites...click the HTML Form Snippet action link for a Profile below -"
" and copy and paste the HTML form code into any web page."
msgstr "<strong>HTML obrazec Snippet</strong> - Če želite več nadzora nad obliko postavitev, ali želite dodati obrazce za vnos profila v bloke, strani in/ali strani, ki niso CiviCRM...kliknite HTML obrazec Snippet action link za spodaj Profil - in kopirajte in prilepite HTML obliko kodo v katero koli spletno stran."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"The HTML Form Snippet code will display a form consisting of the active "
"fields in this Profile. You can copy this HTML code and paste it into any "
"block or page on your website where you want to collect contact information."
msgstr "Koda HTML obrazca Snippet bo prikazala obrazec, sestavljen iz aktivnih polj v tem profilu. To kodo HTML lahko kopirate in prilepite v katerikoli blok ali stran na vaši spletni strani, kjer želite zbrati kontaktne podatke."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"By changing the relative URLs included in the snippet to absolute URLs (e.g."
" change "
"\"/sites/all/modules/civicrm/bower_components/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js?r=dXCgD\""
" to "
"\"https://yourdomain.com/sites/all/modules/civicrm/bower_components/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js?r=dXCgD\")"
" you will be able to use the snippet on any website."
msgstr "S spreminjanjem relativnih URL- jev, vključenih v snipt, na absolutne URL-je (npr. sprememba \"/sites/all/modules/civicrm/bower komponents/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js?r=dXCgD\" na \"https://yourdomain.com/sites/all/modulles/civicrm/bower komponents/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js?r=dXCgD\") boste lahko uporabili snippet na kateri koli spletni strani."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If the web page you are pasting the snippet code to is hosted in a different"
" domain from your CiviCRM site, you may NOT be able to include Country and "
"State fields in the form (the script which dynamically loads the states "
"based on selected country may not be able to execute across domains)."
msgstr "Če je spletna stran, na katero prilepite kodo snipet, gostujoča v drugi domeni kot vaša spletna stran CiviCRM, morda NE boste mogli vključiti polj države in države v obliki (scena, ki dinamično nalaga države, ki temeljijo na izbrani državi, morda ne bo mogla izvesti v različnih domenah)."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"You can control the web page that someone is directed to AFTER completing "
"the form by modifying the contents of the hidden <strong>postURL</strong> "
"input field. Replace the default value with any valid complete URL prior to "
"saving the form code to the desired page(s)."
msgstr "Spletno stran lahko nadzorujete tako, da spremenite vsebino skritega.<strong>podurl</strong>polje za vnos. Privzeto vrednost zamenjajte s katerim koli veljavnim popolnim URL- jem, preden shranite kodo obrazca na želene strani."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "PRIMER:"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid "http://www.example.com/thank_you.html"
msgstr "http://www.example.com/hvala you.html"

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"If the form is submitted with errors (i.e. required field not completed...) "
"- the default behavior is to display the errors within the 'built-in' "
"profile form. You can override this behavior - specifying your own error "
"page - by adding a hidden <strong>errorURL</strong> input field."
msgstr "Če je obrazec predložen z napakami (tj. zahtevano polje ni izpolnjeno...) - privzeto vedenje je prikaz napak v obliki \"vgrajenega\" profila. To vedenje lahko zaobidete - določitev lastne strani napake - z dodajanjem skrite<strong>napakaURL</strong>vhodno polje."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.hlp
msgid ""
"Make sure the CAPTCHA feature is NOT enabled for this profile when you are "
"grabbing the HTML code. CAPTCHA requires dynamic page generation. Submitting"
" an HTML Snippet profile form with CAPTCHA included will ALWAYS result in a "
"CAPTCHA validation error - which means that the information entered by the "
"user can not be saved."
msgstr "Prepričajte se, da funkcija CAPTCHA ni omogočena za ta profil, ko grabite HTML kodo. CAPTCHA zahteva dinamično ustvarjanje strani. Pošiljanje HTML Snippet profila z vključenim CAPTCHA bo vedno povzročilo napako v potrjevanju CAPTCHA - kar pomeni, da informacij, ki jih uporabnik vnese, ni mogoče shraniti."

#: templates/CRM/UF/Page/Group.tpl
msgid ""
"The HTML code below will display a form consisting of the active fields in "
"this Profile. You can copy this HTML code and paste it into any block or "
"page on your website where you want to collect contact information."
msgstr "Koda HTML spodaj bo prikazala obrazec, sestavljen iz aktivnih polj v tem profilu. To kodo HTML lahko kopirate in prilepite v katerikoli blok ali stran na vaši spletni strani, kjer želite zbirati kontaktne podatke."

