#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "Title not Set"
msgstr "Naslov ni nastavljen"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "Version information missing in civicrm database."
msgstr "Podatki o različici manjkajo v podatkovni zbirki Citizenrm."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"Database check failed - the database looks to have been partially upgraded. "
"You may want to reload the database with the backup and try the upgrade "
"process again."
msgstr "Preverjanje zbirke podatkov ni uspelo - zdi se, da je bila baza podatkov delno nadgrajena. Morda boste želeli ponovno naložiti zbirko podatkov z varnostno kopijo in ponovno poskusiti proces nadgradnje."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "Version information missing in civicrm codebase."
msgstr "Podatki o različici manjkajo v kodni bazi."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"Your database is marked with an unexpected version number: %1. The automated"
" upgrade to version %2 can not be run - and the %2 codebase may not be "
"compatible with your database state. You will need to determine the correct "
"version corresponding to your current database state. You may want to revert"
" to the codebase you were using prior to beginning this upgrade until you "
"resolve this problem."
msgstr "Vaša podatkovna zbirka je označena z nepričakovano številko različice: %1. Avtomatizirana nadgradnja različice %2 ne more biti zagnana - in kodna baza %2 morda ne bo združljiva z vašim stanjem baze podatkov. Določiti boste morali pravilno različico, ki ustreza vašemu trenutnemu stanju baze podatkov. Morda se boste želeli vrniti v kodebazo, ki ste jo uporabljali pred začetkom te nadgradnje, dokler ne rešite te težave."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php CRM/Upgrade/Page/Upgrade.php
msgid "Your database has already been upgraded to CiviCRM %1"
msgstr "Vaša baza podatkov je že bila nadgrajena v CiviCRM %1"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"CiviCRM versions prior to %1 cannot be upgraded directly to %2. This upgrade"
" will need to be done in stages. First download an intermediate version (the"
" LTS may be a good choice) and upgrade to that before proceeding to this "
"version."
msgstr "CiviCRM različice pred %1 ni mogoče nadgraditi neposredno v %2. Ta nadgradnja bo treba narediti v fazah. Najprej prenesete vmesno različico (lahko LTS je dobra izbira) in nadgraditi na to pred nadaljevanjem te različice."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"CiviCRM %3 requires PHP version %1 (or newer), but the current system uses "
"%2 "
msgstr "CiviCRM %3 zahteva PHP različico %1 (ali novejši), vendar trenutni sistem uporablja %2 "

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"CiviCRM %4 requires MySQL version v%1 or MariaDB v%3 (or newer), but the "
"current system uses %2 "
msgstr "CiviCRM %4 zahteva MySQL različico v%1 ali MariaDB v%3 (ali novejši), vendar trenutni sistem uporablja %2 "

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "CiviCRM %1 requires MySQL trigger privileges."
msgstr "CiviCRM %1 zahteva MySQL sprožilne privilegije."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "CiviCRM %1 requires MySQL thread stack >= %2k"
msgstr "CiviCRM %1 zahteva MySQL nit stack pple %2k"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"CiviCRM %1 requires <code>CIVICRM_CRED_KEYS</code>. Please add it to "
"<code>civicrm.settings.php</code>."
msgstr "CiviCRM %1 zahteva <code>CIVICRM_CRED_KEYS</code>. Prosimo, da ga dodate v <code>civicrm.setts.php</code>."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"This example includes a randomly generated key. You may copy it directly or "
"create your own random value."
msgstr "Ta primer vključuje naključno ustvarjen ključ. Lahko ga neposredno kopirate ali ustvarite svojo naključno vrednost."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "For details, see <a %1>Sysadmin Guide: Secret Keys</a>."
msgstr "Za podrobnosti glej <a %1>Sysadmin Guide: Tajni ključi</a>."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "Your database is not configured for version %1"
msgstr "Vaša zbirka podatkov ni nastavljena za različico %1"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "Failed to find or create queueing table"
msgstr "Ni moč najti ali ustvariti tabele v vrsti"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "Some old files could not be removed. Please remove them."
msgstr "Nekaterih starih datotek ni bilo mogoče odstraniti. Prosim, odstranite jih."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "The extension %1 is now obsolete and has been disabled."
msgstr "Podaljšek %1 je zdaj zastarel in onemogočen."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"The obsolete extension %1 could not be removed due to an error. It is "
"recommended to remove this extension manually."
msgstr "Zaradi napake ni bilo mogoče odstraniti zastarele razširitve %1. Priporočljivo je ročno odstraniti to razširitev."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "The extension %1 is now obsolete and has been uninstalled."
msgstr "Podaljšek %1 je zdaj zastarel in je bil odstranjen."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "You can remove it from your extensions directory."
msgstr "Lahko ga odstranite iz imenika razširitev."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"A replacement extension %1 has been installed as you had the obsolete "
"extension %2 installed"
msgstr "Nameščena je bila nadomestna razširitev %1, saj ste imeli nameščeno zastarelo razširitev %2"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid ""
"The replacement extension %1 could not be installed due to an error. It is "
"recommended to enable this extension manually."
msgstr "Nadomestne razširitve %1 zaradi napake ni bilo mogoče namestiti. Priporočljivo je, da to razširitev omogočite ročno."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Form.php
msgid "Rebuild"
msgstr "Znova zgradi"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Headless.php CRM/Upgrade/Page/Upgrade.php
msgid "CiviCRM Upgrade Tasks"
msgstr "Nadgradnja opravil CiviCRM"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid ""
"This system uses PHP v%4. You may proceed with the upgrade, and CiviCRM v%1 "
"will continue working normally. However, future releases will require PHP "
"v%2. We recommend PHP v%3."
msgstr "Ta sistem uporablja PHP v%4. Lahko nadaljujete z nadgradnjo, in CiviCRM v%1 bo še naprej normalno deloval. Vendar pa bodo prihodnje izdaje zahtevale PHP v%2. Priporočamo PHP v%3."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid ""
"This system uses MySQL/MariaDB v%5. You may proceed with the upgrade, and "
"CiviCRM v%1 will continue working normally. However, CiviCRM v%4 will "
"require MySQL v%2 or MariaDB v%3."
msgstr "Ta sistem uporablja MySQL/MariaDB v%5. Lahko nadaljujete z nadgradnjo, CiviCRM v%1 pa bo še naprej normalno deloval. Vendar bo CiviCRM v%4 zahteval MySQL v%2 ali MariaDB v%3."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid ""
"This system included an outdated, insecure script (%1). The file was "
"automatically deleted."
msgstr "Ta sistem je vključeval zastarelo, nezanesljivo skripto (%1). Datoteka je bila samodejno izbrisana."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid ""
"This system includes an outdated, insecure script (%1). Please delete it."
msgstr "Ta sistem vključuje zastarelo, nezanesljivo skripto (%1). Prosim, izbrišite jo."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid ""
"This database uses InnoDB Full Text Search for optimized searching. The "
"upgrade procedure has not been tested with this feature. You should disable "
"(and later re-enable) the feature by navigating to \"Administer => Customize"
" Data and Screens => Search Preferences\"."
msgstr "Ta zbirka podatkov uporablja InnoDB Polno iskanje besedila za optimizirano iskanje. Postopek nadgradnje ni bil preizkušen s to funkcijo. Treba je onemogočiti (in kasneje ponovno omogoÄ iti) funkcijo z navigacijo na \"Administer => Prilagodite podatke in zaslone => Iskanje Preferences\"."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid "This upgrade will NOT use automatic snapshots."
msgstr "Ta nadgradnja NE bo uporabljala samodejnih posnetkov."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid ""
"If an upgrade problem is discovered in the future, automatic snapshots may "
"help recover. However, they also require additional storage and may not be "
"available or appropriate in all configurations."
msgstr "Če se v prihodnosti odkrije problem nadgradnje, lahko avtomatski posnetki pomagajo obnoviti. Vendar pa tudi zahtevajo dodatno shranjevanje in morda niso na voljo ali primerni v vseh konfiguracijah."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid "Here are the reasons why automatic snapshots are disabled:"
msgstr "Tukaj so razlogi, zakaj so samodejni posnetki onemogočeni:"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid ""
"You may enable snapshots in \"<code>%1</code>\" by setting the experimental "
"option \"<code>%2</code>\"."
msgstr "Lahko omogočite posnetke v \"<code>%1</code>\" z nastavljanjem eksperimentalne možnosti \"<code>%2</code>\"."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/General.php
msgid ""
"The default copies of the message templates listed below will be updated to "
"handle new features or correct a problem. Your installation has customized "
"versions of these message templates, and you will need to apply the updates "
"manually after running this upgrade. <a %1>View detailed instructions</a>."
msgstr "Privzete kopije spodaj navedenih predlog za sporočila bodo posodobljene za obravnavo novih funkcij ali odpravo težav.Vaša namestitev je prilagodila različice teh predlog za sporočila, in boste morali uporabiti posodobitve ročno po zagonu te nadgradnje. <a %1>Poglej podrobna navodila</a>."

