msgid "Norwegian BokmÃ¥l"
msgstr "norveški BokmÃ¥l"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveFortyNine.php
msgid ""
"This site previously executed an early version of 5.49, which may have "
"incorrectly modified some scheduled reminders. After upgrading, review these"
" reminders (<code>%1</code>). <a %2>(Learn more...)</a>"
msgstr "Ta stran je pred tem izvedla zgodnjo različico 5.49, ki je morda nepravilno spremenila nekaj načrtovanih opomnikov. Po nadgradnji, pregled teh opomnikov (<code>%1</code>).<a %2>(Nauči se več ...)</a>"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveFortyOne.php
msgid ""
"A token has been updated in the %1 template. Check the system checks page to"
" see if any action is required."
msgstr "Žeton je bil posodobljen v predlogi %1. Preverite stran za preverjanje sistema, da vidite, če je potrebno kakršno koli dejanje."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveFortySeven.php
msgid ""
"The contact field preferred mail format is being phased out. Modern email "
"clients can handle receiving both formats so CiviCRM is moving towards "
"always sending both and the field will be incrementally removed from the UI."
msgstr "Kontaktno polje zaželena oblika pošte se postopoma opušča. Sodobni e-poštni odjemalci lahko ročaj prejemanje obeh formatov, tako da CiviCRM se giblje proti vedno pošiljanje obeh in polje bo postopoma odstranjen iz UI."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveFortySeven.php
msgid "See the issue for more detail"
msgstr "Za več podrobnosti si oglejte vprašanje"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveFortySeven.php
msgid ""
"Your system has custom field groups with duplicate internal names. To ensure"
" data integrity, the internal names will be automatically changed; user-"
"facing titles will not be affected. Please review any custom code you may be"
" using which relies on custom field group names."
msgstr "Vaš sistem ima prilagojene skupine polj z dvojnimi notranjimi imeni. Da bi zagotovili celovitost podatkov, bodo notranja imena samodejno spremenjena; naslovi, ki se obrnejo na uporabnika, ne bodo prizadeti. Prosimo, da pregledate katerokoli kodo, ki jo morda uporabljate in se zanaša na imena skupin po meri."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveFortySeven.php
msgid "CiviGrant"
msgstr "CiviGrant"

