msgstr "Uvoz podatkov po meri"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveFortyThree.php
msgid ""
"Minor changes have been made to how the tokens to render case.is_deleted, "
"case.created_date and case.modified_date. See "
"https://docs.civicrm.org/sysadmin/en/latest/upgrade/version-specific/ for "
"more"
msgstr "Manjše spremembe so bile narejene na način, kako so žetoni za izvedbo primera.is deljeno, case.ustvarjen date in case.modificirano date. Glej https://docs.civicrm.org/sisadmin/en/late/upgrade/version-specific/ za več"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveFour.php
msgid ""
"A new permission, \"%1\", has been added. It is not granted by default. If "
"your users create reports, you may wish to review their permissions."
msgstr "Dodano je bilo novo dovoljenje, \"%1\". Privzeto ni odobreno. Če vaši uporabniki ustvarjajo poročila, boste morda želeli pregledati njihova dovoljenja."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveFour.php
msgid "save Report Criteria"
msgstr "shrani merila za poročilo"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveNine.php
msgid "Enable multiple bulk email address for a contact"
msgstr "Omogoči večkratni veliki e-poštni naslov za stik"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveNine.php
msgid "Email on Hold"
msgstr "E- pošta na čakanju"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveNine.php
msgid ""
"If the setting \"%1\" is enabled, you should update any smart groups based "
"on the \"%2\" field."
msgstr "Če je omogočena nastavitev \"%1\", morate posodobiti vse pametne skupine na podlagi polja \"%2\"."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveNine.php
msgid ""
"If you were previously on version 5.8 and altered the WYSIWYG editor "
"setting, you should visit the <a %1>Display Preferences</a> page and re-save"
" the WYSIWYG editor setting."
msgstr "Če ste bili prej na različici 5.8 in spremenili nastavitev urejevalnika WYSIWYG, morate obiskati <a %1>Display Preferences</a> stran in ponovno shraniti nastavitev urejevalnika WYSIWYG."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveNine.php
msgid ""
"CiviCRM v5.9+ adds a new search preference for certain custom-fields "
"(\"Money\", \"Integer\", or \"Float\" data displayed as \"Select\" or "
"\"Radio\" fields). For continuity, any old fields have been set to continue "
"the old user-experience. However, you may want to review these settings. "
"(You should especially review if this site used v5.9-alpha or v5.9-beta.)"
msgstr "CiviCRM v5.9+ dodaja novo iskalno prednost za nekatera polja po meri (\"Denar\", \"Integer\" ali \"Float\" podatki prikazani kot \"Izberi\" ali \"Radio\" polja). Za kontinuiteto so bila vsa stara polja nastavljena za nadaljevanje stare uporabniške izkušnje. Vendar pa boste morda želeli pregledati te nastavitve. (Posebno bi morali pregledati, če je ta stran uporabila v5.9-alfa ali v5.9-beta.)"

