msgid ""
"Some custom forms (%1) support authenticated email links. Please review the "
"<strong><a %2>CiviCRM 5.79 Form-Token Notice</a></strong>."
msgstr "Nekatere oblike po meri (%1) podporo overjene e-poštne povezave. Prosimo, preverite<strong><a %2>CiviCRM 5.79 Obvestilo o obliki</a></strong>."

