msgstr "To je %1 token HTML vsebina."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixty.php
msgid ""
"You can now choose whether to use Smarty in Scheduled Reminders at "
"<em>Administer >> CiviMail >> CiviMail Component Settings</em>. The setting "
"is disabled by default on new installations but we have enabled it during "
"this upgrade to preserve the existing behavior. More information <a %1>in "
"this lab ticket</a>."
msgstr "Sedaj lahko izberete, ali boste uporabili Smarty v naročenih opomnikih na <em>administer >> CiviMail >> Nastavitve komponent CiviMail</em>. Nastavitev je privzeto onemogočena na novih napravah, vendar smo jo med to nadgradnjo omogočili za ohranitev obstoječega vedenja. Več informacij <a %1>in ta laboratorijski listek</a>."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyFour.php
msgid ""
"<strong>ACTION REQUIRED</strong>: You will need to apply a <strong>manual "
"update</strong> because your civicrm_activity table is large and the update "
"will run slowly. Please read about <a %1>how to apply this update "
"manually</a>."
msgstr "<strong>ACTION REQURED</strong>: Boste morali uporabiti <strong>manual update</strong>, ker je vaš civilrm aktivnost tabela je velika in posodobitev bo tekla počasi. Prosimo, preberite o <a %1>how za uporabo te posodobitve ročno</a>."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyOne.php
msgid ""
"This release contains a change to the behaviour of recurring contributions "
"under some edge-case circumstances."
msgstr "Ta izdaja vsebuje spremembo vedenja ponavljajočih se prispevkov v nekaterih skrajnih primerih."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyOne.php
msgid ""
"Since 5.49 the amount and currency on the recurring contribution record "
"changed when the amount of any contribution against it was changed, "
"indicating a change in future intent."
msgstr "Od 5.49 sta se znesek in valuta v ponavljajočem se zapisu o prispevkih spremenila, ko se je spremenil znesek katerega koli prispevka proti njemu, kar kaže na spremembo prihodnjega namena."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyOne.php
msgid ""
"It is generally not possible to edit the amount for contributions linked to "
"recurring contributions so for most sites this would never occur anyway."
msgstr "Na splošno ni mogoče urediti zneska za prispevke, povezane s ponavljajočimi se prispevki, tako da za večino strani to ne bi nikoli zgodilo."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyOne.php
msgid ""
"If you still want this behaviour you should install the <a %1>Recur future "
"amounts extension</a>"
msgstr "Če še vedno želite to obnašanje, morate namestiti <a %1>Recur prihodnjih zneskov podaljšanje</a>"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyOne.php
msgid ""
"Please <a %1>read about recurring contribution templates</a> for more "
"information"
msgstr "Prosimo <a %1>read o ponavljajočih se predloge prispevka</a> za več informacij"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyOne.php
msgid ""
"You must do a one-time clear of Drupal caches now before visiting CiviCRM "
"pages to rebuild the menu routes to avoid fatal errors. <a %1>Read more</a>."
msgstr "Narediti morate enkratno čiščenje Drupal predpomnilnikov zdaj pred obiskom strani CiviCRM za obnovo menijskih poti, da bi se izognili usodnim napakam. <a %1>Read more</a>."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyOne.php
msgid "Dedupe cache table"
msgstr "Tabela predpomnilnika Dedupe"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyOne.php
#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyThree.php
#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyTwo.php
msgid "Drop index %1"
msgstr "Spustni indeks %1"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyOne.php
msgid "Update Saved Mapping for contribution import"
msgstr "Posodobi shranjeno kartiranje za uvoz prispevka"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtySeven.php
msgid ""
"This site has custom note privacy options (%1) which may not work correctly "
"after the upgrade, due to the deprecation of hook_civicrm_notePrivacy. If "
"you are using this hook, see <a %2>developer documentation on updating your "
"code</a>."
msgstr "Ta stran ima možnosti zasebnosti po meri (%1), ki morda po nadgradnji ne deluje pravilno, zaradi deprekacije kavlja civicrm  notePrivacy. Če uporabljate ta kavelj, glejte dokumentacijo <a %2>developer o posodobitvi vaše kode</a>."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtySix.php
msgid ""
"If your site uses custom code to inject tracking fields into messages, it "
"may need updating. See <a %1>this issue for details</a>."
msgstr "Če vaša spletna stran uporablja po meri kodo za vbrizgavanje sledilnih polj v sporočila, bo morda treba posodobiti. Za podrobnosti si oglejte <a %1>To vprašanje</a>."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyTwo.php
msgid ""
"This site has multiple \"Domains\". The list of active \"Components\" is "
"being consolidated across all \"Domains\". If you need different behavior in"
" each \"Domain\", then consider updating the roles or permissions."
msgstr "Ta stran ima več \"Domene\". Seznam aktivnih \"komponentov\" se konsolidira v vseh \"Domene\". Če potrebujete drugačno vedenje v vsaki \"Domena\", potem razmislite o posodobitvi vlog ali dovoljenj."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyTwo.php
msgid ""
"Your civicrm.settings.php file contains a line to set the php variable "
"`auto_detect_line_endings`. It is deprecated and the line should be removed "
"from the file."
msgstr "Vaša datoteka civilrm.setts.php vsebuje vrstico za nastavitev spremenljivke php `auto  detect line endings ́. Je deprecirana in vrstico je treba odstraniti iz datoteke."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveSixtyTwo.php
msgid ""
"Note: You might have followed these steps already but unfortunately a "
"previous upgrade which started ignoring the setting to create CiviCase "
"Activity revisions failed to account for all the places this functionality "
"existed. This means that either new Revisions have been added since you "
"removed them, or not all were removed."
msgstr "Opomba: Morda ste že sledili tem korakom, vendar je na žalost prejšnja nadgradnja, ki je začela ignorirati nastavitev za ustvarjanje CiviCase Activity revisions ni upoštevala vseh krajev, kjer je ta funkcionalnost obstajala. To pomeni, da so bile dodane nove Revizije, odkar ste jih odstranili, ali pa niso bile vse odstranjene."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThirteen.php
msgid ""
"If you have created a report based on the Mailing Summary Report template "
"and it outputs or filters on campaigns, You will need to go back to that "
"report and re-save the report after selecting and or setting the campaign "
"filters up again"
msgstr "Če ste ustvarili poročilo na podlagi predloge zbirnega poročila za pošiljanje in izide ali filtrira na kampanjah, boste morali iti nazaj na to poročilo in ponovno shraniti poročilo po izbiri in ali nastavljanje filtrov kampanje spet gor"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThirtyFour.php
msgid ""
"This system has an encrypted SMTP password. Encryption in v5.34+ requires "
"CIVICRM_CRED_KEYS. You may <a href=\"%1\" target=\"_blank\">setup "
"CIVICRM_CRED_KEYS</a> before or after upgrading. If you choose to wait, then"
" the SMTP password will be stored as plain-text until you setup "
"CIVICRM_CRED_KEYS."
msgstr "Ta sistem ima šifrirano geslo SMTP. Šifriranje v v5.34+ zahteva CIVICRM_CRED_KLJUČI.<a href=\"%1\" target=\"_blank\">Nastavitev CIVICRM_CRED_KLJUČ</a>pred nadgradnjo ali po njej. Če se odločite počakati, bo geslo SMTP shranjeno kot navadno besedilo, dokler ne nastavite CIVICRM_CRED_KLJUČ."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThirtyFour.php
msgid ""
"The SMTP password (%1) was previously stored in the database. It has "
"unexpected content which cannot be migrated automatically. However, it "
"appears to be inactive, so the upgrader will drop this value."
msgstr "Geslo SMTP (%1) je bilo prej shranjeno v bazi podatkov. Ima nepričakovano vsebino, ki je ni mogoče samodejno preseliti. Vendar se zdi, da je neaktivna, tako da bo nadgrajenec spustil to vrednost."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThirtyFour.php
msgid ""
"The SMTP password (%1) has unusual content that cannot be stored as plain-"
"text. It may be unreadable due to a previous misconfiguration, or it may "
"rely on an unclear character-set. Your options are:"
msgstr "Geslo SMTP (%1) ima nenavadno vsebino, ki je ni mogoče shraniti kot navaden tekst. Morda je ne berljivo zaradi prejšnje napačne nastavitve ali pa se lahko zanese na nejasen nabor znakov. Vaše možnosti so:"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThirtyFour.php
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%1\" target=\"_blank\">Setup CIVICRM_CRED_KEYS</a> before "
"upgrading. This warning will go away, and the current SMTP password will "
"ultimately be preserved during upgrade."
msgstr "<a href=\"%1\" target=\"_blank\">Setup CIVICRM_CRED_KEYS</a> pred nadgradnjo. To opozorilo bo izginilo in trenutno geslo SMTP bo na koncu ohranjeno med nadgradnjo."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThirtyFour.php
msgid ""
"Proceed with upgrading in the current configuration. The SMTP password will "
"be lost, but you may re-configure it after upgrade."
msgstr "Nadaljuj z nadgradnjo v trenutni konfiguraciji. Geslo SMTP bo izgubljeno, vendar ga lahko po nadgradnji spremenite."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThirtyFour.php
msgid ""
"This system has a PHP override for the SMTP password (%1). The override was "
"most likely encrypted with an old mechanism. After upgrading, you must "
"verify and/or revise this setting."
msgstr "Ta sistem ima PHP povoz za geslo SMTP (%1). Preklic je bil najverjetneje šifriran s starim mehanizmom. Po nadgradnji morate preveriti in/ali revidirati to nastavitev."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThirtySeven.php
msgid ""
"Some mail-merge tokens may display differently when used with Scheduled "
"Reminders, Mosaico templates, or PDF letters. For details, see <a "
"href=\"%1\" target=\"_blank\">upgrade notes</a>."
msgstr "Nekateri žetoni po pošti se lahko prikažejo drugače, če se uporabljajo z naročenimi opomniki, Mosaico predlogami ali PDF črkami. Za podrobnosti glej <a href=\"%1\" target=\"_blank\">upogradne opombe</a>."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThirtySix.php
msgid ""
"CiviCRM v5.36 introduces a new configuration option to support digital "
"signatures. You may <a href=\"%1\" target=\"_blank\">setup "
"CIVICRM_SIGN_KEYS</a> before or after upgrading. The option is not critical "
"in v5.36, but it may be required for extensions or future upgrades."
msgstr "CiviCRM v5.36 uvaja novo možnost konfiguracije za podporo digitalnih podpisov.<a href=\"%1\" target=\"_blank\">Nastavitev CIVICRM_SIGN_KLJUČ</a>možnost ni kritična v v5.36, vendar se lahko zahteva za razširitve ali prihodnje nadgradnje."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveThree.php
msgid ""
