msgstr "Naslednje opcijske skupine niso bile pretvorjene, ker obstaja že druga opcijska skupina z istim imenom v bazi podatkov"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveTwentySeven.php
msgid ""
"Starting with version 5.28.0, CiviCRM will require the PHP "
"Internationalization extension (PHP-Intl). In preparation for this, the "
"system check will show a warning beginning in 5.27.0 if your site lacks this"
" extension."
msgstr "Začenši z različico 5.28.0, bo CiviCRM zahteval razširitev PJZ Internationalization (PHP-Intl). V pripravi na to bo sistemska kontrola pokazala opozorilo, ki se začne na 5.27.0, če vaši spletni strani manjka ta razširitev."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/FiveTwentySix.php
msgid ""
"WARNING: CiviCRM 5.26 and later changes how front-end CiviCRM URLs are "
"formed in WordPress.  Please <a href='%1' target='_blank'>read this blog "
"post before upgrading</a> . You may need to update settings at your payment "
"Processor for recurring payments. If you have an external service that sends"
" callback messages to CiviCRM, you may need to update the settings at the "
"external service to use the new URL format."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: CiviCRM 5.26 in kasneje spremeni, kako se v WordPress oblikujejo naslovi CiviCRM URL-jev. Prosimo, <a href='%1' target='_blank'>read to blog post pred nadgradnjo</a> . Morda boste morali posodobiti nastavitve na vašem plačilnem procesorju za ponavljajoča se plačila. Če imate zunanjo storitev, ki pošilja sporočila za klic v CiviCRM, boste morda morali posodobiti nastavitve na zunanji storitvi za uporabo novega formata URL."

