msgstr "Dodano je bilo novo dovoljenje %1. Privzeto ni izdano. Če uporabljate SMS, boste morda želeli pregledati vaša dovoljenja."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/SixFive.php
msgid ""
"WARNING: Your site is currently using the Smarty2 library which is being "
"replaced by the Smarty5 library."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Vaša spletna stran trenutno uporablja knjižnico Smarty2, ki jo nadomešča knjižnica Smarty5."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/SixFive.php
msgid ""
"If you take no action your site will now switch to using Smarty5. Some sites"
" use extensions which have not been upgraded to work with Smarty5."
msgstr "Če ne ukrepate, bo vaša spletna stran zdaj prešla na uporabo Smarty5. Nekatere spletne strani uporabljajo razširitve, ki niso bile nadgrajene za delo s Smarty5."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/SixFive.php
msgid ""
"If your extensions or other custom code will not run on Smarty5, you should "
"log an issue with the maintainer. If the maintainer does not respond you "
"should consider uninstalling the extension."
msgstr "Če vaše razširitve ali druge po meri kode ne bo teči na Smarty5, morate prijaviti vprašanje z vzdrževalcem. Če vzdrževalec ne odgovori, morate razmisliti o odstranitvi razširitve."

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/SixFive.php
msgid ""
"In the short term you can make your site continue to use Smarty2 by editing "
"your civicrm.settings.php file and adding the line %1"
msgstr "V kratkem času lahko vaše spletno mesto še naprej uporabljati Smarty2 z urejanjem vaše civilrm.setings.php datoteko in dodajanje vrstice %1"

#: CRM/Upgrade/Incremental/php/SixFive.php
msgid ""
"Upcoming versions will standardize on Smarty v5. CiviCRM <a %1>v6.4-ESR</a> "
"will provide extended support for Smarty v2, v3, & v4. To learn more and "
"discuss, see the <a %2>Smarty transition page</a>."
msgstr "Prihajajoče različice bodo standardizirali na Smarty v5. CiviCRM <a %1>v6.4-ESR</a> bo zagotovil razširjeno podporo za Smarty v2, v3, in v4. Če želite izvedeti več in razpravljati, glejte <a %2>Smarty tranzition page</a>."

