#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"This setting is not recommended for Multi-Select or Checkboxes, as indexes "
"are usually not helpful for fields that store multiple values."
msgstr "Ta nastavitev ni priporočljiva za Multi-Select ali Checkboxe, saj indeksi običajno ne pomagajo pri poljih, ki shranjujejo več vrednosti."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid "Public:"
msgstr "Javno:"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Files are directly viewable to anyone with the link (including anonymous). "
"This offers moderate security because link urls are hard to guess, but not "
"impossible."
msgstr "Datoteke so neposredno na ogled vsakomur s povezavo (vključno anonimno). To ponuja zmerno varnost, ker povezavo urls so težko uganiti, vendar ni nemogoče."

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid "Private:"
msgstr "Vojak:"

#: templates/CRM/Custom/Form/Field.hlp
msgid ""
"Files are accesed indirectly via a secure link. Anyone with the link "
"(including anonymous) can use it for a limited time until it expires. "
"Private files are slower to load but improve security by keeping them out of"
" a web-accessible directory."
msgstr "Datoteke se sprejemajo posredno preko varne povezave. Vsakdo, ki ima povezavo (vključno z anonimno) ga lahko uporablja za omejen čas, dokler ne poteče. Zasebne datoteke so počasnejše za nalaganje, vendar izboljšati varnost, tako da jih vodijo izven spletnega dostopnega imenika."

